      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/19cfda3723b833d7baed59661a9f9997f831f85e.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=233efe349d2f7f6b19c038483f232290"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/15924b6cd96e5298e858ef7cc06fb5b84430b7ee.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=28b406315032972b42fe36470f14b7de"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;THE LEGENDS OF VALIANT — ALL IN ONE INCREDIBLE COLLECTION&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Some of the greatest writers and artists in comics have left their mark on the Valiant Universe. Now, their extraordinary work comes together in one massive Humble Bundle. Experience Valiant through the work of legendary and acclaimed artists including Joe Quesada, Barry Windsor-Smith, Bob Layton, Cary Nord, Clayton Crain, Mico Suayan, and Lewis LaRosa — artists whose unforgettable imagery helped define Valiant across generations. And the stories are just as extraordinary. Discover groundbreaking work from an incredible roster of writers including Jim Shooter, Christopher Priest, Jeff Lemire, Matt Kindt, Robert Venditti, Joshua Dysart, Fred Van Lente, and Cullen Bunn — creators who helped build, reinvent, and expand one of the most acclaimed superhero universes in comics. From &lt;em&gt;X-O Manowar and Bloodshot&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Harbinger, Eternal Warrior, Shadowman&lt;/em&gt; and beyond, this isn't simply a collection of great Valiant stories. It's a showcase of the creators who made Valiant legendary. Explore an incredible collection of Valiant comics, choose your price, and support BINC with your purchase. The heroes are iconic. The creators are legendary. The Valiant Universe is yours.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bloodshotsalvation_vol1"&gt;Bloodshot Salvation, Vol. 1: The Book of Revenge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bookofdeath_legendsofthegeomancer_issue1"&gt;Book of Death: Legends of the Geomancer #1