ocode"&gt;Archer &amp; Armstrong Vol 1 The Michelangelo Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archerandarmstrongvol2wrathoftheeternalwarrior"&gt;Archer &amp; Armstrong Vol 2 Wrath of the Eternal Warrior&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archerandarmstrongvol3farfaraway"&gt;Archer &amp; Armstrong Vol 3 Far Faraway&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archerandarmstrongvol4sectcivilwar"&gt;Archer &amp; Armstrong Vol 4 Sect Civil War&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archerandarmstrong_vol5"&gt;Archer &amp; Armstrong Vol 5 Mission Improbable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archerandarmstrongvol6americanwasteland"&gt;Archer &amp; Armstrong Vol 6 American Wasteland&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archerandarmstrongvol7theonepercentandothertales"&gt;Archer &amp; Armstrong Vol 7 The One Percent and Other Tales&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#armorhunterstpb"&gt;Armor Hunters TPB&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bloodshotreborn_vol2"&gt;Bloodshot Reborn, Vol. 2: The Hunt&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bloodshotreborn_vol3"&gt;Bloodshot Reborn, Vol. 3: The Analog Man&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bloodshotreborn_vol4"&gt;Bloodshot Reborn, Vol. 4: Bloodshot Island&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bloodshotsalvation_vol2"&gt;Bloodshot Salvation, Vol. 2: The Book of the Dead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bloodshotsalvation_vol3"&gt;Bloodshot Salvation, Vol. 3: The Book of Revelations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bloodshotusa"&gt;Bloodshot U.S.A.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bookofdeathtpb"&gt;Book of Death TPB&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bookofdeath_legendsofthegeomancer_issue2"&gt;Book of Death: Legends of the Geomancer #2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bookofdeath_legendsofthegeomancer_issue3"&gt;Book of Death: Legends of the Geomancer #3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bookofdeath_legend