      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/acc47a73c6ff04231fdc3da5bdd7528b9dd3796c.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=21b07d057dfb1c9b25ed2e7923ceb8fb"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/90ce04022d2d4ad42d220c97dbbe2f117574b959.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=6574c58da80701bd35ce83b966cb9e00"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;TTRPG greatness awaits with Caverns of Thracia!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Calling all gallant TTRPG adventurers—we’ve teamed up with Goodman Games to curate the battle-ready Caverns of Thracia &amp; More Bundle! A thousand-year-old dungeon mystery is waiting to be solved in &lt;em&gt;Caverns of Thracia&lt;/em&gt;, and some say Death itself lingers within. Designed for 4-6 &lt;em&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics&lt;/em&gt; playable characters, the caverns are suitable as part of an existing campaign or kick off a new one. Pay what you want for &lt;em&gt;Fifth Edition Fantasy #25–29&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #109–111&lt;/em&gt;, alongside goodies like the &lt;em&gt;Goodman Games Yearbooks&lt;/em&gt;! Assemble 4–6 friends and roleplay epic quests within a mega‑dungeon of mystery today! Plus, your purchase helps support Make‑A‑Wish!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bouncebackcouponforgoodmangamesonlinestore"&gt;Bounceback Coupon for Goodman Games Online Store&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dccrpgcorerulebook"&gt;DCC RPG Core Rulebook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_issue107_forgottendangers"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #107: Forgotten Dangers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#goodmangamesgencon2013programbook"&gt;Goodman Games Gen Con 2013 Program Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fiftheditionfantasy_sunkentowerofsetfreerpgday2021"&gt;Fifth Edition Fantasy: Sunken Tower of Set (Free RPG Day 2021)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#originaladventuresreincarnated_issue7_darktower"&gt;Original Adventures Reincarnated #7 - Dark Tower (3 -Volume Set)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#originaladventuresreincarnated_issue8grimtoothsoldschooltraps"&gt;Original Adventures Reincarnated #8 Grimtooth's Old School Traps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_darktower_3volumeset"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics - Dark Tower (3 -Volume Set)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dccreferencebooklet"&gt;DCC Reference Booklet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dccrpgcharacterrecordfolio"&gt;DCC RPG Character Record Folio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_issue84_perilonthepurpleplanet_boxedboxeddccr"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #84: Peril on the Purple Planet - Boxed (Boxed DCC RPG Adv. Set)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_issue841_therockawakens"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #84.1: The Rock Awakens (DCC RPG Adv., Digest Sized)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_issue842_syntheticswordsmenofthepurpleplanet"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #84.2: Synthetic Swordsmen of the Purple Planet (DCC RPG Adv.)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_issue843_skymastersofthepurpleplanet"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #84.3: Sky Masters of the Purple Planet (DCC RPG Adv.)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_issue97_thequeenofelflandsson"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #97: The Queen of Elfland's Son (DCC RPG Adv.)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_issue98_imprisonedinthegod-skull"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #98: Imprisoned in the God-Skull (DCC RPG Adv.)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlclassics_issue106_trialsofthetrapmasterstomb"&gt;Dungeon Crawl Classics #106: Trials of the Trapmaster's Tomb&lt;/a&gt;&lt;