      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3a7cededf00532633a78aae2e01f7fae0b8a01b8.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=b5181a8d88300627b674de34dd773848"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0430e91192f933715148e3bc5daf19f3c55d0b30.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=81057ee39fdc5f916cd22f86f340bc6d"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The perfect POLY asset collection.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Game developers, build your worlds easily and efficiently with our latest &lt;em&gt;POLY&lt;/em&gt; Game Dev Asset Collection by Animpic Studio! Pay what you want for thousands of sharp assets from professional‑quality packs like &lt;em&gt;POLY - Survival Subway&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;POLY - Survival Tower &amp; Builder&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;POLY - Fantasy House &amp; Builder&lt;/em&gt;. These Unity and Unreal Engine‑compatible packs include FBX models, prefabs, materials, shaders, and multiple scene files. Create picture‑perfect polygon‑based assets without straining your team or wallet, and help support Save the Children with your purchase!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivalmeleeweapons"&gt;POLY - Survival Melee Weapons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_megasurvivalfood"&gt;POLY - Survival Food&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivalkit"&gt;POLY - Survival Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_sci-fisandbox"&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Sandbox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_sci-fiplanetarystation"&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Planetary Station&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_sci-ficharacterandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Character &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_nature"&gt;POLY - Nature&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivalweapons"&gt;POLY - Survival Weapons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_megasurvivalconstructionkitgodot"&gt;POLY - Survival Construction&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivalvehicles"&gt;POLY - Survival Vehicles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivalworkshop"&gt;POLY - Survival Workshop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivalsubway"&gt;POLY - Survival Subway&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_megasurvivaltools"&gt;POLY - Survival Tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivalmedical"&gt;POLY - Survival Medical&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivaltowerandbuilder"&gt;POLY - Survival Tower &amp; Builder&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_survivalcharacterandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Survival Character &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_modulareasternrifleandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Modular Eastern Rifle &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_modularwesternrifleandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Modular Western Rifle &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fantasyassetcreationinblender4_completelowpoly3dmodelmasterclass"&gt;POLY - Fantasy Camp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_fantasycharacterandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Fantasy Character &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_fantasyhouseandbuilder"&gt;POLY - Fantasy House &amp; Builder&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#splinebuilderplugin"&gt;Spline Builder Plugin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#housebuilderplugin"&gt;House Builder Plugin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#poly_coupon10"&gt;Coupon $10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivalmeleeweapons"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivalmeleeweapons"&gt;POLY - Survival Melee Weapons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0f4150cc4c1ec930d7e2ccc320d7b0153069e4f0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=79b19c588c12183c52ec6c7ca489447d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Melee Weapons brings 57 low-poly models to survival and post-apocalyptic projects, from knives and axes to improvised weapons. Combine tactical blades, reinforced bats, hand tools, and repurposed everyday objects to give scavenged equipment a varied, makeshift character. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender, the collection supports weapon displays, loot presentations, survivor hideouts, and game prototypes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_megasurvivalfood"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_megasurvivalfood"&gt;POLY - Survival Food&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c7abc8c9b8d5af133fc8505a96cc312afc92c61e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2f29f3577bc6d67aa7b88321e35f33f7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Food by Animpic Studio brings low-poly food and drink props to survival camps, stocked shelters, shops, and everyday interiors. Combine meat and fish, fruit and vegetables, prepared meals, canned provisions, bottles, and water containers to give your scenes distinct sources of supplies. The pack contains 232 model variations, with releases for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivalkit"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivalkit"&gt;POLY - Survival Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/836ecd3af72372f0d7faec1cea2ce294e03819e5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6b3908f17b6f09db96a9666658a087b6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Kit by Animpic Studio is a low-poly collection of 370 unique assets for wilderness camps, survival outposts, and supply locations. Combine tents, camping gear, tools, medical supplies, provisions, weapons, transport props, and natural scenery to build places that show how people shelter, travel, and prepare. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender. The current Unreal Engine archive contains a reduced selection of the collection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_sci-fisandbox"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_sci-fisandbox"&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Sandbox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e911199addc551900599ed8801d64b05f419fbdc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=92290527faf924d2c127771aa3603164"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Sandbox is a low-poly collection for building planetary colonies, industrial outposts, and research environments, with 387 unique assets. Combine circular habitat structures, connecting corridors, laboratory equipment, industrial machinery, mineral deposits, and alien vegetation to shape a settlement and its surrounding landscape. Includes project releases for Unity and Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_sci-fiplanetarystation"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_sci-fiplanetarystation"&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Planetary Station&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7739e7e250be187608e1489df37de49836090893.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=618b0037e6308c982c02a68f70e9b856"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Planetary Station is a low-poly environment pack with 152 core assets for building remote planetary outposts and research bases. Shape a station with structural panels, floors, roofs, and window sections, then furnish its working and living spaces with laboratory equipment, storage, terminals, and everyday props. The verified release is supplied as a Unity package. The Unreal Engine download currently contains the Unity package and awaits replacement with native Unreal Engine files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_sci-ficharacterandcustomizer"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_sci-ficharacterandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Character &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5a5336804e2fc9029f99f08419f5702064865431.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d3e3d8d49f890e2b31b84c8b337d2046"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Sci-Fi Character &amp;amp; Customizer is a low-poly character pack built around a helmeted operative, interchangeable equipment, and a Unity customization studio. Combine chest armour, heavy armour, an exoskeleton, and a jetpack, then adjust material finishes and colours to create distinct explorers, station personnel, and security teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_nature"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_nature"&gt;POLY - Nature&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a7181d43201781d13405798e575bc7db7d3d33e6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1372e1d791b04a17c09e6c50829ccf92"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Nature brings 364 unique low-poly assets to forests, meadows, rocky landscapes, and waterside scenes. Combine broadleaf trees and conifers with fallen timber, berry bushes, grasses, mushrooms, flowers, rocks, and cloud models to create varied natural settings. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender, the collection supports outdoor world building from quiet woodland paths to colorful autumn clearings and reed-lined shores.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivalweapons"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivalweapons"&gt;POLY - Survival Weapons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d8809ecbf3a5e21091d04e9b1f7894b3cc393271.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8af75eac3dc5cfd1c9bce6e32f42be77"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Weapons Kit brings 294 low-poly assets to armories, equipment displays, and survival game environments. Combine weapon models with modular visual attachments, magazines, ammunition, melee items, and storage props to create varied equipment presentations. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender, the pack covers firearm families and supporting props for shooter and RPG projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_megasurvivalconstructionkitgodot"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_megasurvivalconstructionkitgodot"&gt;POLY - Survival Construction&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e64e994cc756deb14c1d14d6f405c189c43a7981.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=604330b945d7f8e4c1fe8ee163413f0c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Construction is a low-poly environment pack by Animpic Studio for building shelters, fortified compounds, and post-apocalyptic settlements. Combine modular building parts with defensive structures, furniture, supplies, and outdoor scenery. Damaged wall and roof pieces, makeshift barriers, and everyday camp details help give each location its own survival story. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender, the pack supports prototyping and environment creation for third-person and top-down survival, shooter, and RPG projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivalvehicles"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivalvehicles"&gt;POLY - Survival Vehicles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7a4468c813e2c3c8b8f0140e21303356f85754e5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1708195c749a89e46a88f6266e6b9f7d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Vehicles brings a low-poly collection of fortified transport to post-apocalyptic scenes, from a towering tanker truck to improvised armored cars. Create evacuation routes, survivor convoys, or roadside checkpoints with vehicles defined by protective grilles, timber reinforcements, and heavy bumpers. The pack lists 19 model variations and includes releases for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivalworkshop"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivalworkshop"&gt;POLY - Survival Workshop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3813d2116d52318a539ec35ae06b1e0389a52753.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f43413a0a3f4acaf64608a694adc3d8f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Workshop brings 212 unique low-poly assets to modular workshops, improvised shelters, and survivor bases. Build the structure with walls, floors, roofs, foundations, doors, and windows, then furnish it with workbenches, tools, storage, utility details, and everyday supplies. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender, the pack combines a practical repair workspace with living-area furniture and small props for inhabited or abandoned survival scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivalsubway"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivalsubway"&gt;POLY - Survival Subway&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/53684121011b197b1ee3bebb036615eb54c9fb37.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5913318cc46561ab8b3e0742ff38403a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Subway brings 513 low-poly models to underground stations, rail tunnels, and improvised survival shelters. Build metro environments with modular platforms, walls, stairs, tunnels, train components, utility systems, and detailed station props. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender, the pack combines transit infrastructure with furniture, supplies, and camp items for abandoned or inhabited underground scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_megasurvivaltools"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_megasurvivaltools"&gt;POLY - Survival Tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9a27e4589d5f502093590c8c6c4a3c38b7069a4a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ca16f99bca0dbec344e229063cdb0210"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Tools brings 219 unique low-poly assets to workshops, construction sites, and survival supply yards. Equip your scenes with hand and power tools, workbenches, industrial equipment, building materials, cargo containers, and smaller repair supplies. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender, the pack gives you props for crafting areas, maintenance stations, and improvised bases.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivalmedical"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivalmedical"&gt;POLY - Survival Medical&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/32b2b7e5229d00bcd26eb6120147a9bd15a9b4e6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=daee2fb8eb302c89b95531c10516dbb7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Medical brings 200 unique low-poly assets to field hospitals, quarantine zones, and survival environments. Build medical facilities with modular walls and roofs, a large tent, treatment beds, equipment, and detailed first-aid and laboratory props. Available for Unity, Unreal Engine, Godot, and Blender, the pack supports scene building from isolated treatment stations to abandoned medical compounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivaltowerandbuilder"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivaltowerandbuilder"&gt;POLY - Survival Tower &amp; Builder&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c61dd9a9aadad53b79cb60bdf334033db90d1ddc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8050e183d18390a2c79883fda9c199e9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Tower &amp;amp; Builder is a low-poly collection for building elevated outposts, lookout structures, and fortified shelters. Combine tower frames, platforms, stairs, bridges, cabin walls, doors, windows, and improvised defensive pieces to create a vertical settlement with a weathered survival aesthetic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_survivalcharacterandcustomizer"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_survivalcharacterandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Survival Character &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cfd0be7ed53162041d7c2ecfe6587547af8f8954.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7e1826fb6740e601655f09c04d4fd8f6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Survival Character &amp;amp; Customizer is a low-poly character pack with male and female survivors and a Unity character customization studio. Combine clothing, footwear, hairstyles, headwear, and male beard options, then adjust individual colours to create distinct scavengers, camp residents, and outpost guards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_modulareasternrifleandcustomizer"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_modulareasternrifleandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Modular Eastern Rifle &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/54b84260fb8e15eaeb6cf59fbe98811e642b98ee.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d4750f78981b13db9e959b0173a25ba2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Modular Eastern Rifle &amp;amp; Customizer is a low-poly rifle collection with curved magazines, distinct stock profiles, modular visual components, and six texture finishes. Build equipment displays, survival props, and character loadout presentations using nine assembled Blender variants and separate component groups. Customizer is available for Unity and Unreal Engine; Blender provides the model source without Customizer. Unity, Unreal Engine, and Blender downloads are attached to this listing. The Unreal Engine ZIP is a temporary delivery containing the Unity package.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_modularwesternrifleandcustomizer"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_modularwesternrifleandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Modular Western Rifle &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f32b7f0dd2eb9105ced3032d541d5a5f79faefa7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4d7180464e296592afc035f28358d961"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Modular Western Rifle &amp;amp; Customizer is a low-poly collection of digital rifle models, interchangeable visual components, and texture variants for game and presentation scenes. Explore nine assembled model variants alongside separate body, barrel, forend, stock, magazine, sight, and accessory groups in the supplied Blender source. The Unity download contains Blender source and textures, without native Unity prefabs or a Customizer plugin. A separate Blender ZIP is provided. The Unreal Engine download temporarily contains the same Unity package and awaits native Unreal Engine files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasyassetcreationinblender4_completelowpoly3dmodelmasterclass"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasyassetcreationinblender4_completelowpoly3dmodelmasterclass"&gt;POLY - Fantasy Camp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/80eb2a9903da38589691c2cac5671b161cdea71e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=70b31a7f528ec700469e16e9b3647f9d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Fantasy Camp is a collection of 156 stylized low-poly assets for building colourful forest camps, guarded outposts, and fantasy wilderness settlements. Arrange tents, wooden and stone barriers, campfire pieces, furniture, storage props, weapons, trees, rocks, and vegetation into compact campsites or larger fortified clearings. The Unity package includes FBX models, prefabs, materials, shaders, and four scene files. An Unreal Engine download is also selected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_fantasycharacterandcustomizer"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_fantasycharacterandcustomizer"&gt;POLY - Fantasy Character &amp; Customizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c700cfab0970766ec713123bb79cdae90e188ace.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=54f01434d036903a18b58f43618d8ec1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Fantasy Character &amp;amp; Customizer brings stylized low-poly male and female characters to medieval villages, fantasy adventures, and RPG casts. Combine clothing, hairstyles, facial details, gloves, and colour palettes to give townsfolk, travellers, companions, and player characters distinct looks within one consistent visual style. The Unity package includes Character Studio tools for selecting parts, adjusting colours, randomizing appearances, and saving character looks. An Unreal Engine download is also selected; its current temporary ZIP will be replaced with native Unreal Engine files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_fantasyhouseandbuilder"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_fantasyhouseandbuilder"&gt;POLY - Fantasy House &amp; Builder&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/33323b0332a2d2191e758852af2c8b9d139dd54a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=303be1497e5a0770cdab8f09e3afa7e8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;POLY - Fantasy House &amp;amp; Builder brings 187 low-poly architectural assets to fantasy village creation, with tiled roofs, timber framing, brickwork, arched doors, and varied windows. Combine roof sections, beams, planks, chimney pieces, and facade details into cottages, village streets, or woodland settlements. The Unity package includes matching prefabs, two village scenes, materials, and a stylized grass system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="splinebuilderplugin"&gt;&lt;a id="splinebuilderplugin"&gt;Spline Builder Plugin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/34fe3459dd348dbec0878e11c96330011d06d15a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c5ba66808a1e63a256a8c49cce562594"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Spline Builder Plugin is a terrain-aware construction tool for arranging modular 3D objects along editable spline paths. It is suited to fences, walls, cables, and other repeated environment structures. Choose between Repeated Prefabs and Stretch Mesh placement. Multiple Object Rows can share one path while keeping independent modules, intervals, gaps, offsets, rotations, scales, endpoint rules, and alignment settings. Scene View editing, rebuild and clear controls, Undo/Redo support, and contained generated output help keep iteration manageable. Project deliveries are selected for Unity and Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="housebuilderplugin"&gt;&lt;a id="housebuilderplugin"&gt;House Builder Plugin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ce3ae1338899b97d804ef22b63877ee7f5923e32.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bda23a4ebe0c9f90903ddb753988ffbc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;House Builder Plugin is a modular construction tool for creating customizable stylized houses with adjustable floors, walls, roofs, doors, and windows. Configure ground and upper floors, edit individual facades, select compatible opening modules, change wall thickness, and control materials and colours for walls, roofs, timber, doors, and windows. The builder includes gable-roof settings, roof tiles, attachments, and a prepared MeadowVillage example. Unity and Unreal Engine are selected for this product.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="poly_coupon10"&gt;&lt;a id="poly_coupon10"&gt;Coupon $10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1de546f5e78cae870433c7b34396dec71d9ce909.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ec3afcf919e0619eaec15b7c727ef4c6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;$10 Animpic Store coupon for game assets and tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
