der and FBX files make it a versatile character for games, animations, and design projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="businessmancharacter"&gt;&lt;a id="businessmancharacter"&gt;Business Man Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ba9941360bc9538dc067f71e3e647001c1861412.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6e3e9d4b9417433126102f0e84e90e3c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Business Man Character 3D Model - Fully rigged 3D character with clean topology, Rigify rigging system with face rig, 20 premade poses, PBR materials and production-ready lighting. Includes Blender (.blend) and FBX files. Perfect for business presentations, corporate branding, animation, games, and design projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="doctorcartoonmalecharacter"&gt;&lt;a id="doctorcartoonmalecharacter"&gt;Doctor Cartoon Male Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2e9e58718e6c8fe4df6f2dd990a7bc79473a5c9c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3f2272ef32d292452697219745f311ca"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Doctor Cartoon Male Character 3D Model - Professional rigged cartoon doctor character in Blender with advanced face and body rigging system included. Includes Blender (.blend), FBX, GLB, and OBJ files. Perfect for medical animations, healthcare games, and design projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartoonwhitewomanteen"&gt;&lt;a id="cartoonwhitewomanteen"&gt;Cartoon White Woman Teen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9c2b9b48aa53a1363a78877ef8f8a07e9552d976.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cc670f0f6703976de586c1ec9113debc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cartoon White Woman Teen 3D Model - Professional rigged cartoon character in Blender with advanced face and body rigging system included. Includes Blender (.blend), FBX, and OBJ files. Perfect for animation, games, and design projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="universitystudent"&gt;&lt;a id="universitystudent"&gt;University Student&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a3af6e1fcbd7cb38415eaa5f2a5f74d0ade731a3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3e42585f998ed27a6f7225fed3961b1e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;University Student 3D model for sale. Rigged stylized character with 52 ARKit blendshapes, Blender Expression and Lipsync panels for games, animation, education apps, and marketing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gamergirlwhitewoman"&gt;&lt;a id="gamergirlwhitewoman"&gt;Gamer Girl White Woman&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/01f855fee1dfdb6294bdc42a71c6679f19a5e74f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e0781ebe3fd3dd8306362abe515acec6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gamer Girl White Woman - Fully rigged 3D character for Blender with ARKit blendshapes, lipsync-ready expressions, and 31 premade poses. Perfect for games, animations, VFX, and real-time facial animation. Includes Blender, FBX, OBJ, GLB files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="lionmascot"&gt;&lt;a id="lionmascot"&gt;Lion Mascot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/02a6f72cd96c137d7e1e2bc274323a78e9d56ed4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9035e5b454ff6738bc03cfab466ef690"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stylized Cartoon Lion Mascot 3D Model - Professional rigged lion character in Blender with face rig included. Perfect for mascot design, branding, games, and animations. Includes Blender, FBX, OBJ, GLB files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animalz"&gt;&lt;a id="animalz"&gt;Animalz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/82308aa17394ae0c38b81874c0dc5bc8d5382468.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=df8d6a022eae0133e978d9b3306ff777"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring your projects to life with 16 charming 3D cartoon animals, from pandas and foxes to turtles and dragons. Each animal comes with 50 prepared poses and full body and facial rigs. Includes customizable Blender files, studio lighting, and high-resolution transparent PNGs for illustrations, games, and animations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bodiez"&gt;&lt;a id="bodiez"&gt;Bodiez&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f86142900ee454ba9b09f2284e24d2406f3fa7c0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=744af3920e01ef39db37f8a33ca28451"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shape your next character with customizable male and female 3D mannequins for Blender. Adjust body types and proportions with simple sliders, then pose them with the included rig. Clean quad topology makes Bodiez a flexible starting point for modeling and sculpting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="emoticonz"&gt;&lt;a id="emoticonz"&gt;Emoticonz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5a3b28ec3a184efe5ee868cc3c534a00dec9d3b9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a148e7d55e90fb228e8157eb40c4599c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Express emotions with 93 animated 3D emojis in Blender, PNG, and GIF formats. Ready-to-use across UI/UX, video, and presentation tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="threedeeheadgenerator"&gt;&lt;a id="threedeeheadgenerator"&gt;ThreeDee Head Generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fdcf13cf53e4cfdb8822638b9ea8520c2b640292.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=68ad6488f1e605d6c65e46b85cda691e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generate, shape, pose and animate unique human heads directly in Blender with ThreeDee Head Generator. Fully offline and built for Blender 4.5 LTS+.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gamerz_maleedition"&gt;&lt;a id="gamerz_maleedition"&gt;Gamerz - Male Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8d8ebaaed4346eaf42b13bc217a78a75c34f963a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=78afe2a9bbf0fbcde9bb53aff3328f89"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your next game with a customizable, game-ready low-poly male character. Mix clothing, hairstyles, shoes, and accessories into 171,600 base looks. Includes editable Blender files, materials, textures, gameplay animations, and 52 ARKit blendshapes with lipsync for expressive heroes and NPCs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gamerz_femaleedition"&gt;&lt;a id="gamerz_femaleedition"&gt;Gamerz - Female Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/886124e73513bfa1e8f826204de6fa18dc4c63a3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=927816714036476e6996c625ee8324da"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your next game with a customizable, game-ready low-poly female character. Mix clothing, hairstyles, shoes, and accessories into 121,000 base looks. Includes editable Blender files, materials, textures, gameplay animations, and 52 ARKit blendshapes with lipsync for expressive heroes and NPCs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="humanz_maleedition"&gt;&lt;a id="humanz_maleedition"&gt;Humanz - Male Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e2ffa82fac0d7b137eb6e7b3a879be7406357959.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d2e3e0ba136a40ceb75d943194d2f6a0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a memorable cast from one versatile low-poly male character. Combine hairstyles, outfits, and accessories, then set the scene with 40 ready-made poses. Full face and body rigging, lipsync, ARKit blendshapes, and predefined facial expressions make it easy to bring your characters to life in animations, VR/AR experiences, or as AI-driven talking characters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="humanz_femaleedition"&gt;&lt;a id="humanz_femaleedition"&gt;Humanz - Female Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d24a8f52f5aa9a38fbe19507ef6113e623a636d6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=85a7e54f249405c8aa058ecbfeca6409"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring personality to your projects with a charming low-poly female character. Mix and match outfits, hairstyles, and accessories, with full face and body rigging and 40 ready-made poses. Lipsync, ARKit blendshapes, and predefined facial expressions support expressive animation for VR/AR experiences and AI-driven talking characters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="jamez"&gt;&lt;a id="jamez"&gt;Jamez&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4844649fce979642a0dc93bb66104cb04d1ff924.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4d82b381685d46643952845fc222c938"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get one consistent, fully rigged cartoon man in 7 complete looks for $99. Jamez includes office, business casual, casual plaid, king, pilot, wizard, and builder outfits with ARKit blendshapes, lipsync, facial expressions, and Blender source files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="characterz_adultz"&gt;&lt;a id="characterz_adultz"&gt;Characterz - Adultz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/daeb62602aaf5b7f9fa21c6b4dcf1fb0f6f92e21.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c15c4d326f7dfbe56983e2fab326cc21"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a cast full of personality with beautifully stylized, modular adult 3D characters. Mix hairstyles, outfits, accessories, and poses for countless unique looks. Includes Blender source files, full face and body rigging, lipsync, ARKit blendshapes, and predefined facial expressions for animations, VR/AR experiences, and AI-driven talking characters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vehiclez"&gt;&lt;a id="vehiclez"&gt;Vehiclez&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a188d11a04be03ad4ccd5fe51fd314b2cc1996d8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b5b0070a35af8a5be4ccb2e21a70c07f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring your scenes to life with 21 charming, fully rigged cartoon vehicles. Customize colors, add your own logos, open doors, and switch on the lights, perfect for playful animations, games, and illustrations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="headzmaleversion"&gt;&lt;a id="headzmaleversion"&gt;Headz Male version&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7d61bb2eae049c50eaf0a9a96c904e9d35e93634.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=489b7ab50a8f9b78d9e01d54567e8e16"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An Apple Memoji alternative with expressive, modular male 3D heads. Customize hairstyles, accessories, and expressions for your own unique avatars. Includes PNGs, Blender files, 52 facial blendshapes, and 15 visemes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="headzkidsversion"&gt;&lt;a id="headzkidsversion"&gt;Headz Kids version&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/495698eed219bda90bf0ecaadcb8a8d674982564.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=04de298f83dd50a142974912f2188a30"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A playful Apple Memoji alternative with customizable 3D heads of kids. Create expressive young avatars for illustrations, apps, and animations, with 52 ARKit blendshapes to bring their personalities to life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stickz_maleedition"&gt;&lt;a id="stickz_maleedition"&gt;Stickz - Male Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fa627359d03e95dc28d44903571b723f9d87bf64.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2589c210a2933fa63206d6877cffaf14"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give your stories a playful cast with versatile male 3D stick figures. Build distinctive characters from modular hairstyles, clothing, and accessories, with 18 ready-made outfits to get you started. Includes 2,300+ high-resolution PNGs, Blender source files, fully rigged characters, and prepared poses for lively illustrations and animations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stickz_femaleedition"&gt;&lt;a id="stickz_femaleedition"&gt;Stickz - Female Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/af16b24c69b23532be4aada562d4575e4cca646e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=67ac3ebda121f2542d3c4a9f7a655d8e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create expressive female stick figures with modular hairstyles, clothes, and accessories. Includes Blender source files, 21 ready-made outfits, and 2,000+ high-resolution PNGs. Fully rigged characters and prepared poses make it easy to bring your ideas to life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartoonblackfamily"&gt;&lt;a id="cartoonblackfamily"&gt;Cartoon Black Family&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fc988517e9bb096402d97e7a910774bfaeea822f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=831da883b8895052dc5de687ef5be109"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complete Cartoon Black Family 3D Models Pack with 4 fully rigged characters. These models are great for professional 3D animation. Includes adults and teens in Disney/Pixar style. Blender files, FBX, GLB, OBJ formats included. Perfect for professional 3D animation, games, and design projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
