      <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/771f53ebec8f2d3d838113f82393905bbfe73f05.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=1eff028a6e40fbe4da82505eef05b135"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d4959c96fc909a4dd2c1a57f7a939c9ec48edb13.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=de68da5e588caae4682b3dad6b8cb505"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Get battle‑ready with web dev bootcamps.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Attention, cadettes—learn vital front‑end skills with the Front End Web Development Bootcamp Bundle. This battle‑tested 10‑course web development bundle from Treehouse prepares you for creative warfare, then tests your comprehension with a final tech‑degree exam and certification. Unlock instructor‑led video courses and go from cadet to major with lessons like &lt;em&gt;Unit 1: Build a Personal Profile Page&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Unit 2: Create a Mobile‑First Responsive Layout&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Unit 3: Build an Online Registration Form&lt;/em&gt;. Level up your skills with expert instruction—and help support Girls Who Code with your purchase!&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys Expire. Please redeem before September 18, 2027.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/br&gt; &lt;iframe width="450" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qihaecQSTmo?si=OAZR6U672gWOW7Mn" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $45 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit1_buildapersonalprofilepage"&gt;Unit 1: Build a Personal Profile Page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit2_createamobile-firstresponsivelayout"&gt;Unit 2: Create a Mobile-First Responsive Layout&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit3_buildanonlineregistrationform"&gt;Unit 3: Build an Online Registration Form&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit4_buildawebstyleguide"&gt;Unit 4: Build a Web Style Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit5_buildaninteractivephotogallery"&gt;Unit 5: Build an Interactive Photo Gallery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit6_createagameshowapp"&gt;Unit 6: Create a Game Show App&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit7_buildawebappdashboard"&gt;Unit 7: Build a WebApp Dashboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit8_useanapitocreateanemployeedirectory"&gt;Unit 8: Use an API to Create an Employee Directory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit9_capstoneprojectportfolio"&gt;Unit 9: Capstone Project Portfolio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unit10_useaitorebuildthegameshowapp"&gt;Unit 10: Use AI to Rebuild the Game Show App&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#finaltechdegreeexamandcertification"&gt;Final Techdegree Exam and Certification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $45 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit1_buildapersonalprofilepage"&gt;&lt;a id="unit1_buildapersonalprofilepage" href="https://youtu.be/TYphXW9BiSw"&gt;Unit 1: Build a Personal Profile Page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customize a personal online profile by adding graphics, customizing text, and improving the look of a web page using Cascading Style Sheets, the formatting language of the web. Share your finished project on GitHub, a website used by teams of programmers to share and work on programming code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit2_createamobile-firstresponsivelayout"&gt;&lt;a id="unit2_createamobile-firstresponsivelayout" href="https://youtu.be/hyw3lxpTGNY"&gt;Unit 2: Create a Mobile-First Responsive Layout&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Designing web pages that look and function well on multiple screen sizes is an essential skill for a web developer. Using HTML, CSS, and responsive design, you'll create a mobile-first web page with a layout that adjusts to fit mobile phones, tablets, and desktop displays.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit3_buildanonlineregistrationform"&gt;&lt;a id="unit3_buildanonlineregistrationform" href="https://youtu.be/Zoew4DwjT_0"&gt;Unit 3: Build an Online Registration Form&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Web forms appear everywhere online: forms allow users to order books, sign up for websites, and post to Facebook. This project challenges you to build a responsive, mobile-first registration form using a variety of HTML form elements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit4_buildawebstyleguide"&gt;&lt;a id="unit4_buildawebstyleguide" href="https://youtu.be/MfOTZ0C2FIk"&gt;Unit 4: Build a Web Style Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sass is an important tool in a modern Front End Web Developer's toolbox. It's used by many developers to make styling web pages with CSS easier and faster. Create a style guide that can act as your own personal and custom Bootstrap that you can drop into any of your projects to speed up styling, layout and development in general.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit5_buildaninteractivephotogallery"&gt;&lt;a id="unit5_buildaninteractivephotogallery" href="https://youtu.be/KUhs401DdSY"&gt;Unit 5: Build an Interactive Photo Gallery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interactive image galleries are a common feature of many websites, from photo sites to e-commerce applications. Use HTML, CSS and the popular programming language JavaScript to create an interactive, searchable gallery of photos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit6_createagameshowapp"&gt;&lt;a id="unit6_createagameshowapp" href="https://youtu.be/bN961h2_xHc"&gt;Unit 6: Create a Game Show App&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this project, you'll create a browser version of “Wheel of Success”, a word-guessing game. You'll use Javascript to come up with a random phrase that players will try to guess by entering different letters into the program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit7_buildawebappdashboard"&gt;&lt;a id="unit7_buildawebappdashboard" href="https://youtu.be/XVoLIh1NV5A"&gt;Unit 7: Build a WebApp Dashboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build an interactive dashboard for a web application using advanced web techniques including SVG graphics and JavaScript programming. The project involves creating tables, charts, graphics and other user interface components in a manner that promotes interactivity and usability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit8_useanapitocreateanemployeedirectory"&gt;&lt;a id="unit8_useanapitocreateanemployeedirectory" href="https://youtu.be/pF7lyY0eNv4"&gt;Unit 8: Use an API to Create an Employee Directory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Many sites — Facebook, IMDB, and Wikipedia to name a few — offer a vast sea of data that you can access and display on your own web pages. Using JavaScript, you'll create an employee directory by communicating with a third-party API (Application Programming Interface).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit9_capstoneprojectportfolio"&gt;&lt;a id="unit9_capstoneprojectportfolio" href="https://youtu.be/ldJfy_9sAyM"&gt;Unit 9: Capstone Project Portfolio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The final capstone project for the Front End Web Development Techdegree Program. Show off your skill and expertise in the tools and techniques you've learned in the Techdegree by building a professional portfolio to showcase your work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unit10_useaitorebuildthegameshowapp"&gt;&lt;a id="unit10_useaitorebuildthegameshowapp" href="https://youtu.be/VlstrZw3y-I"&gt;Unit 10: Use AI to Rebuild the Game Show App&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this project, you'll prompt an AI coding partner to create a browser version of “Wheel of Success”, a word-guessing game. You'll use Javascript to come up with a random word that players will try to guess by entering different letters into the program. You'll also call a dictionary API to retrieve and display the words' definition as a hint and provide different difficulty and theme options.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="finaltechdegreeexamandcertification"&gt;&lt;a id="finaltechdegreeexamandcertification"&gt;Final Techdegree Exam and Certification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e268596eeefa7b3d22ca003b003940012310c25c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=94b826d2afd621f73b39b20f497ae639"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Graded exam&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Digital certificate for LinkedIn&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Professional portfolio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Exclusive alumni perks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Networking &amp;amp; mentorship opportunities&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
      <category>software</category>
      <category>Front End Web Development Bootcamp Bundle</category>
      <category>11 items</category>
      <category>$2,189 Value</category>
