our own characters and content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="schooldayscontentpack"&gt;&lt;a id="schooldayscontentpack" href="https://youtu.be/X745vhfsCVk"&gt;School Days Content Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;It’s back to school time with Moho, the best way to learn the basics of animation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The School Days content pack for Moho Debut and Pro gets you started with fun, pre-animated content and sample animation files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="125credittowardsmohopro14upgrade"&gt;&lt;a id="125credittowardsmohopro14upgrade"&gt;$125 Credit Towards Moho Pro 14 Upgrade&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ebff8fa529f674caa363cff0b928394008d3ff07.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d009936be3b19be8deab3f840be578fa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get a unique $125 redemption credit towards the purchase of Moho Pro 14&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
