ete environment pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This package includes a fully built showcase level with a unique location featuring multiple zones to explore, ready for you to customize and integrate into your own project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pack is designed for a plug-and-play workflow: simply drag and drop the assets into your scene and start building.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Included Content:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* 1 Showcase Level&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* 1 Asset Showcase Level&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* 56 Unique Static Meshes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Sci-Fi Base Built on the Cliffs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Multiple Zones to Explore&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Easily Editable Materials&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* LODs, Collisions, and Lightmaps Included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Complete Sci-Fi Cliff Base Environment&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Unique Location with Various Zones to Explore&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Plug-and-Play Workflow&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Easy Color, Texture, and Surface Customization&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Optimized for Games&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Production-Ready Assets&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Lightweight and Easy-to-Use Workflow&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Simply Drag and Drop the Assets into Your Scene&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Supports Lumen for Unreal Engine 5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Technical Details:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Number of Unique Meshes: 56&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Collision: Yes, automatically generated and per-poly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* LODs: Yes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Number of Materials: 4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Number of Material Instances: 10&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Number of Textures: 34&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Texture Resolutions: 2K–4K&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="shipwreckunderwaterfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="shipwreckunderwaterfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/kHhqtZkeZr8"&gt;Shipwreck Underwater (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore the hidden treasures underwater with this complete environment pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This packa