ropsvol1"&gt;&lt;a id="medicalpropsvol1"&gt;Medical Props Vol1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dd60350f5bad97d34faeaf7938fa2032cf38e75c.png?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=45da35082f890c1cff78634bc65b3f6f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;4.26 - 4.27, 5.0 - 5.3&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Are you looking to populate your environment with top-notch assets? This is a small collection of high-quality props included in our Apocalyptic Hospital&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;pack. (Volume 1)&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Unique Meshes and Tri counts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Number of Unique Meshes: 123&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collision: Yes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;LODs: Yes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Number of Materials and Material Instances: 62&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Number of Textures: 174&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Number of Blueprints: 31&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Texture Resolutions: 512x512, 1024x1024,2048x2048&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="carnival_meshingun"&gt;&lt;a id="carnival_meshingun" href="https://youtu.be/cVwYWZE354s"&gt;THE CARNIVAL - [Theme Park / Amusement Park]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;☃️ NEW CHRISTMAS UPDATE ☃️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A new free Christmas upgrade is available which includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;New cozy snowy level with holiday decoration&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A beautiful Christmas tree and many holiday gifts and props&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Advanced snow shader with many controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Snow particle system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New Christmas theme park music&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;More!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/3TUktend3w" target="_blank"&gt;Join our Discord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;to get the latest updates, support, participate in contests, and win prizes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.artstation.com/artwork/0lad05" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detailed Images and Videos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/fantasy/the-carnival-304088" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unity Store&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/cVwYWZE354s" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Watch Trailer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/15qLiv2P-w7x8te1-AXC01WwZbgnclAiO/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playable Demo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1M32n96pe-Jg1TdlZTxGDl49U00Metpd5/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4K Wallpapers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FpUEjkbdDEAtHhKrv_NxmuRCsWVoy5cKCNDhUBDId7k/edit" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FpUEjkbdDEAtHhKrv_NxmuRCsWVoy5cKCNDhUBDId7k/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.a4g2uyha17in" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset List&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Carnival: Creepwood Wonderland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;An immersive experience over a year in the making. This package delivers a highly polished and feature-rich carnival environment designed to elevate your projects with realism, atmosphere, and gameplay-ready systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Upgrades Roadmap&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Circus Upgrades&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced Settings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Drop Tower&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Roller Coaster&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FpUEjkbdDEAtHhKrv_NxmuRCsWVoy5cKCNDhUBDId7k/edit#heading=h.pkluhlcv7sve" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read the full roadmap and documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Features&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fully Animated Rides&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Speed customization, smooth motion loops, and sound integration&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audio Enriched&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ambiences, ride sounds, announcements, and music&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Carnival Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Control rides, lighting, wind, optimization, and sound&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unreal Engine 5 Ready (FAB Exclusive)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Lumen enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Showcase Map&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Creepwood Wonderland&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Day/Night variations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview Levels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set dressing layout&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tutorials&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ride variations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retro Visual &amp;amp; Audio Style&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;11 Rides&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Balloon Tower, Bumper Cars, Carousel, Circus, Clown Ride, Ferris Wheel, Flying Bob, Haunted House, Hot Air Balloon, Pirate Ship, Swing, Teapot&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;6 color variations per ride&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;352 Static Meshes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;61 Audio Tracks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prefabs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decorated shops, booths, and food trucks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meshingun Master Material&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blueprints&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Flag/Lightbulb Generator&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customizable shops and food trucks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Social&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/meshingun.studio" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instagram&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/meshingunstudio" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.facebook.com/meshingun.studio" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facebook&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/meshingun-studio/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.artstation.com/meshingun-studio" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ArtStation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;h3 id="apocalyptichospital"&gt;&lt;a id="apocalyptichospital" href="https://youtu.be/chXYheJubdw"&gt;Apocalyptic Hospital&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;─────────────── LINKS ───────────────&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/3TUktend3w" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Discord&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to get the latest updates and news about our products, get support, participate in our contests and win exciting prizes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JSFILMZ Youtube channel&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/v3ZAywh_UjY" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Review&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Also available on&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/industrial/apocalyptic-hospital-264702" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unity Store&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Play&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IH_ZhM1ipYmPhLPge_RXPpaU1OC1V18t/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hospital Demo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Watch&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/chXYheJubdw" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Showcase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Read Asset Pack Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Zs25zWoCrGx6ymkbWu_MlBzWSPwCEcU7/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out the complete&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LzXezU20e9uwRkuFlfW0gcQL-y02jplFtm5UwknTZoM/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;List of assets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;──────────── DISCLAIMER ─────────────&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- This product supports Nanite and Lumen for Unreal Engine 5.0+ (&lt;a href="https://docs.unrealengine.com/5.0/en-US/lumen-global-illumination-and-reflections-in-unreal-engine/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to enable Lumen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; in your project)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Lighting setups are different in UE4 and UE5 versions because of Lumen. The current promotional images are all captured in the UE5 version.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;====================== Package Hierarchy&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contains all assets from &lt;a href="https://www.unrealengine.com/marketplace/en-US/product/00663ce3fbdd43608ff6b27628c9c2d6" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apocalyptic Office Props Vol1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contains all assets from &lt;a href="https://www.unrealengine.com/marketplace/en-US/product/9a76e16023b1497f925453b364b22976" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Medical Props Vol1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;======================&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;───────────── SOCIAL──────────────&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/meshingun.studio" target="_blank"&gt;INSTAGRAM&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/meshingunstudio" target="_blank"&gt;YOUTUBE&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.facebook.com/meshingun.studio" target="_blank"&gt;FACEBOOK&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/meshingun-studio/" target="_blank"&gt;LINKEDIN&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.artstation.com/meshingun-studio" target="_blank"&gt;ARTSTATION&lt;/a&gt;&lt;h3 id="feudaljapanmegapackextrapack"&gt;&lt;a id="feudaljapanmegapackextrapack" href="https://youtu.be/1ykMzp4cVeA"&gt;Feudal Japan Megapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Unreal Engine Versions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;5.1 - 5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is one of the largest libraries of Japanese assets with remarkable quality, delicate details, and enormous scale alongside handy blueprints, tools, and templates to allow you to bring your imagination to life quickly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤With more than 400 assets and prefabs, this is the largest library of high-end quality assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Nanite &amp;amp; Lumen Compatible&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Vast modifiability and customizability, along with handy blueprints, decals, and tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ All the modular assets in this pack are snappable to the grid for easy assembly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Our master materials are some of our most valuable assets which you will get for free in this pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ The master materials give the user easy access to modify parameters globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Pre-arranged prefabs to allow you quickly set dress your environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gothicinteriormegapack"&gt;&lt;a id="gothicinteriormegapack" href="https://youtu.be/WSUqPZvVU4I"&gt;Gothic Interior Megapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Unreal Engine Versions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4.24 - 4.27, 5.0 - 5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is one of the largest libraries of Gothic interior assets with incredible quality, delicate details, and mesmerizing architecture alongside handy blueprints, tools, and templates to allow you to bring your imagination to life quickly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤With 400 assets and prefabs, this is the largest library of Gothic high-end quality assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Nanite &amp;amp; Lumen Compatible (UE5+ version only)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Vast modifiability and customizability along with handy blueprints, tools, and prefabs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ 2 different lighting setups, Lumen vs screen space(legacy) for easy use with PCs with different performances.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ All the modular assets in this pack are snappable to the grid for easy assembly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Our master materials, are some of our most valuable assets which you will get for free in this pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ The master materials give the user easy access to modify parameters globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ A user-friendly book stack creator tool with several parameters for customization.&lt;/p&gt;"&lt;h3 id="france_wwiiliberation_worldwar2andww2"&gt;&lt;a id="france_wwiiliberation_worldwar2andww2" href="https://youtu.be/imayBpEE8zA"&gt;WW2 - France Liberation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Updates&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The issue with the project files has been resolved.&lt;/strong&gt; Please restart your Epic Launcher, clear the local cache files, and download the package again. The package size is approximately 24 GB.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For those who were affected, please reach out to our email to receive your free gift.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;p&gt;You need to enable &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;ChaosVehiclesPlugin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; in your project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/3TUktend3w"&gt;Join our Discord&lt;/a&gt; to get the latest updates and news about our products, get support, participate in contests, and win exciting prizes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Detailed Images And Videos Here (Coming soon)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Coming to Unity Soon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Watch &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/imayBpEE8zA"&gt;Liberation Trailer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Watch &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/jj8QqEiihvg"&gt;Tech Trailer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Watch &lt;a href="https://www.wwiiwalkthrough.meshingunstudio.com/"&gt;Walkthrough Video&lt;/a&gt; (Coming soon)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Watch &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zfIAudEaHBA"&gt;SmartPoly's Review&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Download &lt;a href="https://discord.gg/3TUktend3w"&gt;Playable Demo&lt;/a&gt; from our Discord channel, located under -playable-demos&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Read WWII Liberation: &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/15GFarJQnrFBj0UlDT0GBIWS6xswP3kJXnVOzU1083T0/edit?usp=sharing"&gt;Documentation&lt;/a&gt; (Updating)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Check out the complete &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/15GFarJQnrFBj0UlDT0GBIWS6xswP3kJXnVOzU1083T0/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.a4g2uyha17in"&gt;List of assets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Download &lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UewqVz-EDCz4vRyoCA4EbuUb6dj65HXM/view?usp=sharing"&gt;Config&lt;/a&gt; folder (Optional: to ensure appropriate engine settings)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;World War 2: Liberation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Introducing &lt;strong&gt;World War 2: Liberation&lt;/strong&gt;, a sprawling wartime environment and the most expansive, customizable WW2 pack on the marketplace. This collection is created for all media usage, such as games, cinematic trailers, movies, and more. The level is optimized with a variety of workflows. It is our biggest and most customizable city pack yet, with over a thousand detailed assets, modular buildings, drivable vehicles, and a ton of useful tools, even for your other projects and environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Upgrades Roadmap&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We appreciate your reviews. They inspire us to create even more ambitious content.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Bullet Decals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Drivable French WWII Plane&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Cafe Props&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;These features will be developed as a bonus to encourage community feedback if the pack is well received. Your reviews help shape the future of this pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want more details?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/15GFarJQnrFBj0UlDT0GBIWS6xswP3kJXnVOzU1083T0/edit?usp=sharing"&gt;Read the documentation here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Asset Pack Manager&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Full control of the level, lights, wind, optimization functions, and sound with a robust system to manage your pack.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Made for Unreal Engine 5 + Exclusive on Fab&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Built from the ground up for optimal performance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Lumen enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Levels and Maps&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 Showcase Map: Paris / European City&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Day, war fog, and midnight lighting&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 Overview Levels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assets Palette&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Master Material Guide&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Powerline Generator Tutorial&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Gritty Visuals&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We bring you back to the 1940s with custom visuals, post-processing, filmic color grading, and many more atmospheric touches.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;6 Rigged Drivable Vehicles&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1940s Car Types 1, 2, and 3&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Damaged versions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Truck&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Field Car&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tank (not drivable)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;880 War-Torn Assets&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Building architecture assets&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Props such as chairs, light poles, debris, curtains, desks, and other warzone elements&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Foliage with damaged trees, plant pots, grass, and more&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Prefabs&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assembled city buildings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assembled residential buildings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Church&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Meshingun Master Material (New Update)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Built-in powerful all-in-one shader&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Supports wetness/rain and snow&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Ultimate Glass Shader (New)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Built-in powerful all-in-one glass shader&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Glass shards&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Windows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fake interiors&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Building Customization&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjust the color of walls, bricks, doors, windows, shops, and more&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Uses a new optimized workflow&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjust glass types per instance, including broken, fake interior, translucent, and more&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Blueprints&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Updated Powerline Generator&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pole Sign&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Light Poles&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Road Tool&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Simple Splines: Fence, Canal, Tram Track&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Niagara Systems&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Papers flying&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Leaves flying&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plane war formation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Parachute soldiers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bird flock system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;And many more&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Burning Cloth (New)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;New addition to our Master Material&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Can be applied to any mesh&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Uses vertex color as a mask&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Burning Decal (New)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Can be applied for an aerial burning effect&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjust the emissive, black mask, and more&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Some of the bullet impact effects, explosions, and soldier characters shown in the cinematic trailer are not included in the pack. They are accessible from the Fab marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Social&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/meshingun.studio"&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/meshingunstudio"&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.facebook.com/meshingun.studio"&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/meshingun-studio/"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.artstation.com/meshingun-studio"&gt;ArtStation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;h3 id="gothicmegapackue"&gt;&lt;a id="gothicmegapackue" href="https://youtu.be/koPqcKscRiI"&gt;Gothic Exterior Megapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Unreal Engine Versions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4.25 - 4.27, 5.0 - 5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of the main focuses of the pack is modularity and customizability to give users a wide range of choices. All the modular assets in this pack are snappable to the grid for easy assembly. The master materials used inside the pack give the user easy access to modify parameters globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optimization was one of our main goals in developing this pack. All textures, models, shaders, and tools are optimized and tested in real-time build to make sure they look good while they perform well. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤With 300 assets and prefabs, this is the largest library of Gothic high-end quality assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Nanite &amp;amp; Lumen Compatible (UE5+ version only)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Vast modifiability and customizability along with handy blueprints, tools, and prefabs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ All the modular assets in this pack are snappable to the grid for easy assembly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Our master materials, are some of our most valuable assets which you will get for free in this pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ The master materials give the user easy access to modify parameters globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Highly customizable Railing tool with different Banisters, Newels and Props&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Highly customizable Wall tool&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Sidewalk and Pavement Tool&lt;/p&gt;"&lt;h3 id="medievalvillagemegapack"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalvillagemegapack" href="https://youtu.be/s45StGqqBg0"&gt;Medieval Village Megapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Unreal Engine Versions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4.24 - 4.27, 5.0 - 5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;More than 550 assets/ More than 100 prefabs/Customizable NPC character/Game ready for high-end production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Nanite &amp;amp; Lumen Compatible&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ With over 550 assets, this is the largest library of Romanesque Medieval high-end quality assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Bonus customizable NPC character with 5 different premade variations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Vast modifiability and customizability along with handy blueprints, tools, and prefabs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ One of the main focuses of the pack is modularity and providing prefabs for effortless world-building.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ All the modular assets in this pack are snappable to the grid for easy assembly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Our master materials, are some of our most valuable assets which you will get for free in this pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ The master materials give the user easy access to modify parameters globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ A user-friendly weather control(Snow and rain on surfaces), wind control tool, and Thunder Lightning simulator.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ As this is a Game Ready asset pack, Optimization was one of our first priorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ In-depth Documentation PDF along with in-editor descriptions and info cards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stylizedvillagefatpack"&gt;&lt;a id="stylizedvillagefatpack" href="https://youtu.be/PioekVIpkZQ"&gt;Stylized Village Fatpack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Unreal Engine Versions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4.23 - 4.27, 5.0 - 5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stylized Village is an asset pack made by collaboration between MESHINGUN STUDIO  and William Tate. The environment is inspired by Fantasy and Stylized themes. It contains 3 pre-assembled maps to showcase possible different atmospheres and settings. Pack includes 450 unique high-quality static meshes, around 300 textures, and more than 100 material instances. All static meshes include LODs up to 8 level and imposter LODs are also created for larger foliage to ensure optimal performance. The variety of modular assets in this pack give you the possibility to make your own fantasy game world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Nanite &amp;amp; Lumen Compatible&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Over 450 assets&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Vast modifiability and customizability along with handy blueprints, tools, and prefabs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ All the modular assets in this pack are snappable to the grid for easy assembly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Our master materials, are some of our most valuable assets which you will get for free in this pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ The master materials give the user easy access to modify parameters globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ As this is a Game Ready asset pack, Optimization was one of our first priorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="lighthouse_meshingun"&gt;&lt;a id="lighthouse_meshingun" href="https://youtu.be/TJGPPeMylDc"&gt;THE LIGHTHOUSE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Description&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/3TUktend3w"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Discord&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;to get the latest updates and news about our products, get support,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;participate in our contests and win exciting prizes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.artstation.com/artwork/Ez0oze"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detailed Images And Videos Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt; Coming to Unity Soon&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Watch&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/TJGPPeMylDc"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE LIGHTHOUSE - UE5 Island Level | Playable Open World + Full Interior&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt; Watch &lt;strong&gt;Walkthrough Video&lt;/strong&gt; (Coming Soon)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Download&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/3TUktend3w"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playable Demo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;from our Discord channel (located under -playable-demos)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Read THE LIGHTHOUSE:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XK1oVww_EF-G4cdkECHsZRDuVsmNKjcyJ380P87J4kk/edit?usp=sharing"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Updating)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Check out the complete&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XK1oVww_EF-G4cdkECHsZRDuVsmNKjcyJ380P87J4kk/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.a4g2uyha17in"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;List of Assets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt; Download&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UewqVz-EDCz4vRyoCA4EbuUb6dj65HXM/view?usp=sharing"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Config Folder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Optional: to ensure appropriate engine settings)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Introducing &lt;strong&gt;THE LIGHTHOUSE&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lighthouses always carry a kind of magic. There is a calm beauty in the way&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;they rise against the sea, guiding travelers through the dark, but they also&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;hold a quiet mystery that makes them perfect for horror.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That contrast is what inspired us to create this pack, and we hope you enjoy&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;building your own worlds with it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Upgrade Roadmap&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Sunset Lighting Scenario&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Control Flyable Helicopter&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;These features will be developed as a bonus to encourage community feedback&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;if the pack is well received. Your reviews help shape the future of the lighthouse.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want more details?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XK1oVww_EF-G4cdkECHsZRDuVsmNKjcyJ380P87J4kk/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.gjdgxs"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read the Full Roadmap and Documentation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Made for Unreal Engine 5&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Built from the ground up for optimal performance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite Enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Modular / Extendable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;HLODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;World Partition Level&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Lumen Enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Lowpoly Baked Workflow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Usable for VR, Mobile, and lower-end systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Showcase Map&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Island Environment&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Daylight Lighting&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dynamic Lighting&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Night Lighting&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Overview Level&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Asset Palette&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Atmospheric Visuals&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A striking lighthouse island with custom visuals,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;post-processing, filmic color grading, and atmospheric effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;4 Customizable Vehicles&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Motorboat&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inflatable Boat&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Helicopter&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Lift Machine&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;350+ Detailed Assets&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Building Architecture&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Environmental Props&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Foliage Assets&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Damaged Trees&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Grass and Vegetation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Prefabs&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assembled Foliage Blocks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assembled Lighthouse&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assembled House&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Master Material&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Built In-House&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Powerful All-in-One Shader&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;PCG Biome&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic Vegetation Variations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Road System&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Dynamic Day &amp;amp; Night&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automatically transitions between day and night with customizable settings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Blueprints&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;LITE Powerline Generator&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vehicles&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Lighthouse Fresnel Lens God Rays&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fence Splines&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Niagara Systems&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Flying Leaves&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Smoke Effects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bird Flock System&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Additional Effects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Social&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/meshingun.studio"&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/meshingunstudio"&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.facebook.com/meshingun.studio"&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/meshingun-studio/"&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href="https://www.artstation.com/meshingun-studio"&gt;ArtStation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;h3 id="bazaar_meshingunstudio"&gt;&lt;a id="bazaar_meshingunstudio" href="https://youtu.be/SnZ7Dm6hPmw"&gt;The Bazaar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Unreal Engine Versions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4.24 - 4.27, 5.0 - 5.4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;More than 250 assets/ Nanite for UE5/ Game ready for mid to high end production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Over 250 assets and 40 Prefabs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Vast modifiability and customizability&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ One of the main focuses of the pack is modularity and providing prefabs for effortless world-building&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ All the modular assets in this pack are snappable to the grid for easy assembly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Our master materials, are some of our most valuable assets which you will get for free in this pack&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ The master materials give the user easy access to modify parameters globally&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ As this is a Game Ready asset pack, Optimization was one of our first priorities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Nanite meshes for UE5 version&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ Lumen lighting for UE5 version&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤ UE4 and 5 optimized&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
