      <title>Lovecraftian Horrors: STL Miniatures Mega Bundle by NSMiniatures</title>
      <author>NSMiniatures</author>
      <link>https://humblebundle.com//software/lovecraftian-horrors-stl-miniatures-mega-bundle-nsminiatures-software</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2d21f910a6703450f6890fb282ffe849bca25c9d</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/aee8489ca971bc6213cdd67c1946ec16dc46b1aa.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=c367f4503e166d1c03c0b8ad80defee4"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/875a1e67b2ce60b099e041de77f0681050b230bb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=5ff106f7d300b5ab77b47c7200b00420"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Spine-crawling Lovecraftian miniatures await.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make your party and foes alike quake in fear at your gorgeously customized miniatures with the all‑new Lovecraftian Horrors: STL Miniatures Mega Bundle by NSMiniatures! Print your own witch‑blood‑drinking, Satan‑worshiping minis from the &lt;em&gt;The Dunwich Horror - Miniatures + Props Collection&lt;/em&gt;, erect windowless crypts dripping with spirits of evil with the &lt;em&gt;Cult of Nyarlathotep - Miniatures + Terrain Collection&lt;/em&gt;, and more with 15+ total packs to choose from. Add depth and darkness to your game night with fully customizable miniatures from the wizards at NSMiniatures, and help support Make‑A‑Wish with your purchase!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cthulhu_thegreatoldone"&gt;Cthulhu - The Great Old One&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hastur_thekinginyellow"&gt;Hastur - The King in Yellow&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yog-sothoth_thebeyondone"&gt;Yog-Sothoth - The Beyond One&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yig_fatherofserpent"&gt;Yig - Father of Serpent&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ithaqua_death-walker"&gt;Ithaqua - Death-Walker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#nyarlathotep_thecrawlingchaos"&gt;Nyarlathotep - The Crawling Chaos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#azathoth_thelordofallthings"&gt;Azathoth - The Lord of All Things&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#shub-niggurath_theblackgoatofthewoodswithathousandyoung"&gt;Shub-Niggurath - The Black Goat of the Woods with a Thousand Young&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tsathoggua_sleeperofnkaiandformlessspawns"&gt;Tsathoggua - Sleeper of N'kai and Formless Spawns&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mhithrhaandhoundsoftindalos"&gt;Mh'ithrha and Hounds of Tindalos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dunwichhorror_miniaturespluspropscollection"&gt;The Dunwich Horror - Miniatures + Props Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cultofnyarlathotep_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;Cult of Nyarlathotep - Miniatures + Terrain Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cultofnyarlathoteppart02_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;Cult of Nyarlathotep Part 02 - Miniatures + Terrain Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cultofcthulhu_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;Cult of Cthulhu - Miniatures + Terrain Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#colouroutofspace_miniaturescollection"&gt;The Colour Out of Space - Miniatures Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#courtofazathoth_miniaturescollection"&gt;Court of Azathoth - Miniatures Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fatherdagonanddeeponehybrids"&gt;Father Dagon and Deep One Hybrids&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="cthulhu_thegreatoldone"&gt;&lt;a id="cthulhu_thegreatoldone"&gt;Cthulhu - The Great Old One&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/deaab9073cc472d562cfd31d116c8b259e7a448b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1999e491116c713a59a8e194d77f0385"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deep beneath the Pacific, Cthulhu lies dreaming in sunken R’lyeh. Bring one of cosmic horror’s most iconic entities to the tabletop with this imposing centerpiece miniature. Includes Cthulhu at 120 mm / 4.72 in, with Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files. A full unsplit version is also included for those who prefer to print the model in one piece.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hastur_thekinginyellow"&gt;&lt;a id="hastur_thekinginyellow"&gt;Hastur - The King in Yellow&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1a198db2cabb11b85531344350621bc970c536aa.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=780e35a3e9f8cd562a016848f6aa0883"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whispered of through forbidden plays, strange symbols and decaying kingdoms, Hastur remains one of the Mythos’ most mysterious entities. This imposing King in Yellow miniature is supplied at 110 mm / 4.33 in and 75 mm / 2.95 in. The model is separated into multiple parts for easier printing, assembly and painting. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="yog-sothoth_thebeyondone"&gt;&lt;a id="yog-sothoth_thebeyondone"&gt;Yog-Sothoth - The Beyond One&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/13fbcb283074dc5103de8dd63f8801aaa7b831c0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6dc35860389c33af778586f85af47acb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Beyond the boundaries of time and space dwells Yog-Sothoth, the All-in-One and One-in-All. Bring this impossible cosmic entity to your tabletop as a striking centerpiece miniature. Yog-Sothoth measures 110 mm / 4.33 in and is separated into multiple parts for easier printing, assembly and painting. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="yig_fatherofserpent"&gt;&lt;a id="yig_fatherofserpent"&gt;Yig - Father of Serpent&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/aa2896161f863949784b8780cba2f3fa6d95e838.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cb41f1d527960ffe172b8f0b27f13163"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Revered and feared by those who worship the serpent, Yig is an ancient presence whose wrath follows anyone foolish enough to harm his children. Yig measures 120 mm / 4.72 in from base to head. Separate parts, a full model and combined body/base versions are included. Highly detailed for easy scaling or downscaling. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ithaqua_death-walker"&gt;&lt;a id="ithaqua_death-walker"&gt;Ithaqua - Death-Walker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/85d0a0a5e696634b9a434d86d020391f5e7be094.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c51ea3e01f0e545839556debb6cb4797"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Across the frozen wastes stalks Ithaqua, a colossal entity carried through blizzards and howling winds. At 170 mm / 6.69 in from base to head, the Death-Walker makes a dramatic centerpiece for frozen horror encounters. Separate parts are supplied alongside full-model and combined body/base versions for larger single-piece prints. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="nyarlathotep_thecrawlingchaos"&gt;&lt;a id="nyarlathotep_thecrawlingchaos"&gt;Nyarlathotep - The Crawling Chaos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/610109ed0b180102d8f37667e8607dde45e39477.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=af209c14bf3989bfebf5c90b672ec5d0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlike the distant gods of the Mythos, Nyarlathotep walks among mankind, taking countless forms and spreading madness in the service of the Outer Gods. This Crawling Chaos miniature is supplied at 110 mm / 4.33 in and 75 mm / 2.95 in. A full unsplit version is also included for one-piece printing. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="azathoth_thelordofallthings"&gt;&lt;a id="azathoth_thelordofallthings"&gt;Azathoth - The Lord of All Things&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f23a1af97e0f370e6149a582a0589e74acc3bf5c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=26fc165a4773b4d745f8542ac8dca99e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the center of ultimate chaos writhes Azathoth, the blind cosmic entity before which reality itself seems insignificant. This centerpiece miniature is supplied at 110 mm / 4.33 in and 75 mm / 2.95 in. The model is separated for easier printing and painting, with letter markings on each tentacle to simplify assembly. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="shub-niggurath_theblackgoatofthewoodswithathousandyoung"&gt;&lt;a id="shub-niggurath_theblackgoatofthewoodswithathousandyoung"&gt;Shub-Niggurath - The Black Goat of the Woods with a Thousand Young&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/414f7a4ae5718f3c189d8eae7d6252ecd4b4a97d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=eedd656e2106c8307e411cecbad22991"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deep within forgotten forests, Shub-Niggurath is worshipped as a monstrous force of fertility and corruption. This pack includes Shub-Niggurath at 110 mm / 4.33 in and 75 mm / 2.95 in, plus four Dark Young designs, each supplied at 32 mm / 1.26 in and 54 mm / 2.13 in. Models are separated where appropriate for easier printing and painting. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tsathoggua_sleeperofnkaiandformlessspawns"&gt;&lt;a id="tsathoggua_sleeperofnkaiandformlessspawns"&gt;Tsathoggua - Sleeper of N'kai and Formless Spawns&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e610443e455bdec5990d2e09e1ac1a2692178bac.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3920b6041fa9588889d4ab89c49187e1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ancient, bloated and terrible, Tsathoggua waits in the darkness of N’kai while his amorphous servants crawl from the shadows. This encounter pack includes Tsathoggua at 120 mm / 4.72 in and three Formless Spawn miniatures at 32 mm / 1.26 in each. Models are separated where appropriate for easier printing and painting. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mhithrhaandhoundsoftindalos"&gt;&lt;a id="mhithrhaandhoundsoftindalos"&gt;Mh'ithrha and Hounds of Tindalos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cab59a7e08ddd42c02c699b86f4bd3db24c7033e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7a2649b6445b0a60cea08b0d154ba20b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Beyond the angles of ordinary reality dwell the Hounds of Tindalos, predators capable of pursuing prey across time itself. This pack includes Mh’ithrha, the Arch-Lord of Tindalos, at 95 mm / 3.74 in tall and 160 mm / 6.30 in long, plus three Hounds of Tindalos, each approximately 40 mm / 1.57 in tall and 75 mm / 2.95 in long. Includes printable STL files for all four creatures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="dunwichhorror_miniaturespluspropscollection"&gt;&lt;a id="dunwichhorror_miniaturespluspropscollection"&gt;The Dunwich Horror - Miniatures + Props Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a6b3b64313216fdce91b1ace47fbb266fca7b6f5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b760e8bcfd992a30c214ba084bfcb30f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Return to Dunwich and recreate one of Lovecraft’s most famous tales. This collection includes the 110 mm / 4.33 in Dunwich Horror; three versions of Wilbur Whateley; Lavinia and Old Whateley; investigators Henry Armitage, Francis Morgan and Warren Rice; plus four printable Necronomicon formats ranging from miniature and pendant versions to a life-size FDM prop with an internal compartment. Professionally pre-supported and print tested. Includes Pre-Supported STL, Unsupported STL and LYS files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cultofnyarlathotep_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;&lt;a id="cultofnyarlathotep_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;Cult of Nyarlathotep - Miniatures + Terrain Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6475b53c49e48fa37399c16b375c497c28044cee.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6d4c5fd4f117ac34e28345382b408c77"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Beneath the sands lies a forgotten cult devoted to Nyarlathotep, the Crawling Chaos. Build a complete Mythos encounter with the Black Pharaoh at 135 mm / 5.31 in and 75 mm / 2.95 in, a 135 mm / 5.31 in Shantak, four 40 mm / 1.57 in cultists and a towering 180 mm / 7.09 in temple gate. A full unsplit Black Pharaoh is also included. Professionally pre-supported and print tested. Includes Pre-Supported STL, Unsupported STL and LYS files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cultofnyarlathoteppart02_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;&lt;a id="cultofnyarlathoteppart02_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;Cult of Nyarlathotep Part 02 - Miniatures + Terrain Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dba3fdece8296282eff78c251e30f22e0b719ade.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=210c37fd5814207d7ea070a84b4e615b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Crawling Chaos has countless faces. This second collection features the Haunter of the Dark at 150 mm / 5.91 in and 200 mm / 7.87 in, an Elder Thing at 75 mm / 2.95 in, four Serpent People and three Mi-Go at 40–50 mm / 1.57–1.97 in, plus the 50 mm / 1.97 in Shining Trapezohedron. A full unsplit Haunter is included. Professionally pre-supported and print tested. Includes Pre-Supported STL, Unsupported STL and LYS files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cultofcthulhu_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;&lt;a id="cultofcthulhu_miniaturesplusterraincollection"&gt;Cult of Cthulhu - Miniatures + Terrain Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/59027a8e7d68fdb22f8a30be8bbb10c9ff07f6fd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=553740a684e18b0250754e7ba64b88a1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cthulhu has awakened, and his followers gather as something ancient rises from beneath the sea. Build a complete Cthulhu-themed encounter with the Sleeper of R’lyeh at 150 mm / 5.91 in and 200 mm / 7.87 in, three 40 mm / 1.57 in tentacles, a 75 mm / 2.95 in Starspawn, four 40 mm / 1.57 in cultists, a sacrificial altar and temple terrain. A full unsplit Cthulhu is included. Professionally pre-supported and print tested. Includes Pre-Supported STL, Unsupported STL and LYS files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="colouroutofspace_miniaturescollection"&gt;&lt;a id="colouroutofspace_miniaturescollection"&gt;The Colour Out of Space - Miniatures Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/23f3bf97c85c0d6b9e8be105bafd910ab6cd39fc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=62252442838819ab3909f074715bc5b0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Something has fallen from the stars onto the Gardner farm, twisting animals, plants and people around an impossible colour. This collection includes five mutated animals at 35–60 mm / 1.38–2.36 in, the Gardner family at 37–53 mm / 1.46–2.09 in, three mutated plants at 40–60 mm / 1.57–2.36 in and the 140 mm / 5.51 in Well-Colour centerpiece. Professionally pre-supported and print tested. Includes Pre-Supported STL, Unsupported STL and LYS files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="courtofazathoth_miniaturescollection"&gt;&lt;a id="courtofazathoth_miniaturescollection"&gt;Court of Azathoth - Miniatures Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ab6ddcdddd66aea3ed389c0da7cc0019ba0b2cbe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bb332864b20360a989d66d27cc219a93"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the center of infinity lies the court of Azathoth, surrounded by impossible beings whose music echoes through the void. This collection includes Azathoth at 140 mm / 5.51 in, Ghroth at 130 mm / 5.12 in, Tru’nembra at 120 mm / 4.72 in, two Servitors of the Outer Gods at 50–70 mm / 1.97–2.76 in and three 50 mm / 1.97 in Flying Polyps. Professionally pre-supported and print tested. Includes Pre-Supported STL, Unsupported STL and LYS files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fatherdagonanddeeponehybrids"&gt;&lt;a id="fatherdagonanddeeponehybrids"&gt;Father Dagon and Deep One Hybrids&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/971ea86dd1d9e28584ea62416cd11e771903de68.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b0acabdcaf9599fa4369bb6f719e1cac"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the black depths rises Father Dagon, ancient lord of the Deep Ones. This pack is ideal for aquatic Mythos encounters and coastal cults, combining Father Dagon at 110 mm / 4.33 in with three Deep One Hybrid miniatures at 32 mm / 1.26 in each. Models are separated where appropriate for easier printing, assembly and painting. Includes Pre-Supported and Unsupported STL files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
