;p&gt;Use Hyper's modular templates as flexible building blocks or combine them with other modular assets. Designed to support multiple genres like Survival, RPG, Shooter, and more&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rocketunrealengineplugin"&gt;&lt;a id="rocketunrealengineplugin" href="https://youtu.be/-j_eFTcEuLY"&gt;Rocket Unreal Engine Plugin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1ba3ccd28efe0d71fb3f3307c940e78c2dc97ce5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=aa49827e75033cae7e514fbdf2ceaae3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;LAUNCH THE ROCKET!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;DRAG IT &amp;amp; DROP IT!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ENJOY THE FREE ASSETS AND ENVIRONMENTS!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;TRY 7-DAY FREE SUBSCRIPTION!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is innovative world of Leartes Studios, where passion for gaming meets Unreal Engine’s possibilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rocket Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drag &amp;amp; Drop 3d Cosmos Assets&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drag &amp;amp; Drop VFX&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drag &amp;amp; Drop Sound&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drag &amp;amp; Drop Materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Download the Cosmos Environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features :&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Quick access Cosmos assets with a simple interface&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Easy to use with a drag drop feature&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Code Modules: Rocket(Editor)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Number Of C++ Classes: 19&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Number of Blueprints: 0&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Network Replicated: No&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Supported Development Platforms: Win64,Mac,Linux&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Supported Target Build Platforms: Win64,Mac, Linux&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For all your promotional requests, technical support needs, suggestions, and refund requests, please create a ticket.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gamesbyhyper50discountcode"&gt;&lt;a id="gamesbyhyper50discountcode"&gt;Games By Hyper 50% Discount Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1e9bf64cb40d44890199b9eeb78dc53de9138e9a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip