      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9c9d390733db465fbca23d15601bb6ea9bd016bc.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=7b133c4bc2fdcf3484898bb636525e63"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ca0692cc4eed602c74c74bc6681b7f8797304fc6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=0fdd1c0ff5cf3898b2364ecdfc7e6af3"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;600+ assets to create massive industrial worlds&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create sprawling factories, diesel-powered districts, heavy construction sites, and mechanized battlefields with the Industrial Lands Bundle by KitBash3D. Packed with industrial environments, bold architecture, armored structures, construction machinery, and powerful mechs, this collection is made for developing worlds with weight, scale, and grit. Build everything from hard-working cityscapes to dystopian strongholds and sci-fi warzones with production-ready assets designed to drop into your workflow. Compatible with Blender, Unreal, and more—these Hollywood-quality assets are ready to elevate your next project to new heights. Plus, your purchase helps support Make-A-Wish!  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. Please redeem before October 28th, 2026. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $10 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#constructionvehicles_crane"&gt;Construction Vehicles - Crane&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironforge"&gt;Iron Forge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dieselpunk"&gt;Diesel Punk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#industrial"&gt;Industrial&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archvogue"&gt;Arch Vogue&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironforgematerials"&gt;Iron Forge Materials&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dieselpunkmaterials"&gt;Diesel Punk Materials&lt;/a