7ce38acd117e5bc7244f464"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A playful mix of quirky, whimsical, and laugh-out-loud tracks made for comedy, cartoons, kids’ content, and lighthearted storytelling. From sneaky pizzicato to upbeat jazz and zany carnival sounds, Wacky World brings fun, mischief, and personality to every scene.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="lunarlandscapes"&gt;&lt;a id="lunarlandscapes"&gt;Lunar Landscapes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/075b3ac674d94fcd21aa06692ec16322bcd78ce5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a24ffe4ddfa2bef605a1a345a2cddcf4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;An immersive collection of sci-fi ambiences built for exploring strange new worlds. Lunar Landscapes blends ethereal drones, alien atmospheres, deep rumbles, space winds, and futuristic textures to bring moons, distant planets, and otherworldly environments to life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="ultimategameaudiotier3coupon"&gt;&lt;a id="ultimategameaudiotier3coupon"&gt;Ultimate Game Audio Bundle - Access 300,000 Premium Music and Sound Effects Coupon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/72aea9daeb9a40c0fbc44c17dea0b64fc0f55187.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5aa2caf9659e8f0e709f64fdf775b607"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ultimate Game Audio Bundle - Access 300,000 Premium Music and Sound Effects Coupon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3 id="featurefilmfestival"&gt;&lt;a id="featurefilmfestival"&gt;Feature Film Festival&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/44e52fcd38efd9a8fb98494f74cd2e02d3408e1e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c500aa6b482447816e949d2833a5742a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;From bittersweet solo piano and brooding western regret to spacey, contemplative drones and subtle romantic undertones, it’s the essential score for character-driven dramas, festival shorts, and narratives that thrive on raw, emotional authenticity. Tell the quiet stories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="symphonicmajestic"&gt;&lt;a id="symphonicmajestic"&gt;Symphonic Majestic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/94042efbb3df13c60aea29a59c9977a58bddd2de.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e162990c0230071eb9156454501fb547"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Symphonic Majestic is a collection of history's most powerful compositions, from Mozart's soaring arias and Vivaldi's exultant concertos to Tchaikovsky's sweeping romanticism. This is the definitive source for unparalleled elegance, heroic fanfares, and profound emotional depth. Convey greatness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasyfrenzy"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasyfrenzy"&gt;Fantasy Frenzy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5743bae20829bdc2f4daac0ae08d8bae028f8d0c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0ac4bdab1fbb02ccc9b24a9062d8f09e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Fantasy Frenzy is a pack of 25 sound effects that brings magical worlds to life — from shimmering spells, twinkling accents, and ethereal ambiences to ghostly apparitions, meteor swoops, and eerie Halloween atmospheres. Playful and dark in equal measure, it covers the full range of fantasy sound design. Perfect for games, animations, and any production where magic needs to feel real.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sadness_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="sadness_audiohero"&gt;Sadness&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/376341503b36e6a822e3ea09bc10c669487335bc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=70816c43df8ee8bcd79b248ede3f5891"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Sadness is 41 tracks that don't flinch. Solo pianos, lamenting strings, and cinematic atmospheres built for the moments in your story that actually hurt — grief, loss, heartbreak, and the kind of quiet that follows tragedy. From Satie's Gymnopédies to original film scores, this pack goes deep. For creators who know that the most powerful scenes don't need action — they need truth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tropicalhouse_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="tropicalhouse_audiohero"&gt;Tropical House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/591b8a22aea9add38a8b170b2c21875718985502.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1a3cb0a5971125f81b2d70dca4d3662b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This is a pack of 31 uplifting electronic tracks built for content that needs energy, optimism, and a sun-soaked vibe. From breezy tropical house and future bass to deep house grooves and urban electro, every track is designed to motivate, elevate, and keep things moving. Perfect for travel videos, fitness content, commercials, and anything that deserves a feel-good soundtrack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="percussiontrailer_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="percussiontrailer_audiohero"&gt;Percussion Trailer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e21a7aa1977f6866d9f70dbaf0926b3026ea433b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ecc654bfadb1b72d5f7f6a3aabfe372d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Feel the rush of adrenaline with this percussion trailer music playlist. You will find: pulsing beats and muscular percussion that build tension and drama, standout drum solos and long stringers that amp up the urgency, solo drums and punchy rhythms that create a heroic, confrontational vibe, stressful, urgent tones convey danger and confrontational drama. With its muscular percussion and pulse-pounding drum beats, this playlist creates a dramatic, heroic atmosphere perfect for intense trailer music and standoffs. The urgent rhythms and pounding drums build stress and tension, while the dramatic solos and long stringers create a sense of urgent danger. Put this playlist on loop for high-energy background music that conjures confrontational, heroic drama.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="streetsceneandurbanpulse_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="streetsceneandurbanpulse_audiohero"&gt;Street Scene &amp; Urban Pulse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/45539ddbb5763cadd396fac9bf0d131ae8b52d94.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6cff7eaed8dbd5119b4ae40c3362b1f8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Street Scene &amp;amp; Urban Pulse is 10 tracks that live where the city never sleeps. Funky Memphis horns, hip hop beats, pulsating electronica, and lo-fi menace — this pack captures every side of urban energy, from the swagger of a fashion runway to the tension of a late-night investigation. Gritty, confident, and impossible to ignore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="jazz_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="jazz_audiohero"&gt;Jazz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/295b991e738ab511798da72281f12840c1abedef.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ddd7dafb36f33897a045c4863e220f21"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Jazz is a pack of 49 tracks covering the full spectrum of jazz — from bebop and big band swing to smoky piano bars, sultry blues, and intimate cocktail lounges. Whether you need the energy of a dance floor, the romance of a candlelit dinner, or the cool confidence of a detective story, this pack has the right mood. Timeless, versatile, and endlessly atmospheric.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="latin_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="latin_audiohero"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2925d362c498d9515e7dfff4918448e72a5dfc5c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f72620a772be5981b3a7b5b3a115b45f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This playlist smells like salt, sweat, and midnight. Brass-heavy salsa that moves you without asking permission, vintage mambo, bossa nova that pours like slow coffee, tango with an edge, and guitars that seduce without saying a word. From the beaches of Brazil to the streets of San Juan — if your project needs fire, this is its soundtrack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3 id="easylistening_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="easylistening_audiohero"&gt;Easy Listening&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fabfafcc5e84b291d3d66406437adc06b416a544.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b11b1fdd48a19ffca2206604d92d0e06"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Gentle pianos, warm strings, carefree whistling, and acoustic guitars that feel like a Sunday morning with nowhere to be. From romantic ballads to hopeful indie pop, this pack is the soundtrack to the good stuff — the quiet wins, the slow drives home, and everything beautiful in between.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hypezone_highenergyedits_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="hypezone_highenergyedits_audiohero"&gt;Hype Zone: High Energy Edits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a34a3a107c5df6161c591a6bdabb14efebb9e169.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2f25fb31310f323909b43f05fb524d54"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Dark tension cues, driving rock anthems, and orchestral powerhouses that make every moment feel like the final round. From reality TV elimination scenes to victory laps and all-out competition, this pack doesn't do subtle — it does unforgettable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="darkromanceandgothicatmospheres_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="darkromanceandgothicatmospheres_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Dark Romance &amp; Gothic Atmospheres&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a941dfce40f6f48aa8c2459cc665fbfbc4ea9a58.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=62db3a2dcf6ce6f179a81014a6caa234"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Dark Romance &amp;amp; Gothic Atmospheres is 10 tracks for stories that live in the shadow between desire and dread. Foreboding strings, haunted melodies, and cinematic tension that wraps around you like a secret you shouldn't know. From gothic emptiness to passionate drama and ethereal soundscapes, this pack is for creators who know that the most compelling stories are never entirely light — and never entirely safe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="darkwaveandindustrialpulse_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="darkwaveandindustrialpulse_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Darkwave &amp; Industrial Pulse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/25281411ca2ef847b790b5c074907bf88d3b6dc7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6c87c559cc869d6c990b743b78c2d11c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Darkwave &amp;amp; Industrial Pulse is 10 tracks built from cold steel and hollow frequencies — pulsing electronica, haunting rhythms, and industrial force that doesn't ask for permission. From ice-cold sci-fi wastelands to power tool percussion and driven corporate tension, this pack is for creators who need sound that feels like something breaking, building, or both at once.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="neoclassicaldark_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="neoclassicaldark_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Neoclassical Dark&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/70af4efe2ea4525691b1cccde375e6bf88fb1023.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ca63ea4aa4ed3aee32c2c711cfbbdba0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Neoclassical Dark is 10 pieces drawn from the darkest corners of the classical canon — Tchaikovsky's grief, Vivaldi's menace, Sarasate's longing. Elegant, sorrowful, and timeless, this pack brings the weight of centuries to your most dramatic moments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="chiptuneschronicles_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="chiptuneschronicles_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Chiptunes Chronicles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/90ee2569e164fa5db1ad36f412debdef8bacc177.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=140d373fd7616bbea0bd84fb80f1d8e2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Chiptune Chronicles is 10 tracks that sound like the inside of your favorite game — 8-bit energy, retro beats, and pixel-perfect tension that hits different. From dungeon crawls and boss battles to victory screens and high-speed chases, this pack is pure nostalgia with a modern edge. Level up your content.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tropicalandbeachparty_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="tropicalandbeachparty_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Tropical &amp; Beach Party&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/270f4124fd486d53c1cdb0d3f3e56f214182dc5b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=56cdc34dbccc709950a6f27bb9b402e1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Tropical &amp;amp; Beach Party is 10 tracks that feel like the first day of summer — warm synths, breezy piano, and feel-good beats that make everything look better in sunlight. From chilled tropical house to pumping EDM and nu disco, this pack is built for content that lives outdoors, moves fast, and never stops smiling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="protestsandpoweranthems_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="protestsandpoweranthems_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Protests &amp; Power Anthems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/008ebe25cc997b08ae444dc58147b601d991da1d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=19922198c9c32fd21d322273d2fcff70"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Give powerful stories a soundtrack that carries weight. Tense news themes, cinematic suspense, bold orchestral builds, and anthemic indie rock bring urgency, momentum, and emotion to stories of conflict, resilience, change, and defining moments. Made for documentaries, political storytelling, and editorial productions that need music with impact and purpose.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="slumberandbedtimestories_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="slumberandbedtimestories_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Slumber &amp; Bedtime Stories&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/32233dc1d0c468b400bca5ceddafd63d1a665914.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8a241c0e6078cc87086b340b18b4cf70"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Classic lullabies, gentle music boxes, campfire melodies, and dreamy arrangements — from Brahms to Twinkle Twinkle — everything here is designed to slow the world down and ease little ones into sleep. Warm, tender, and timelessly comforting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="celebrationsandcartoons_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="celebrationsandcartoons_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Celebrations &amp; Cartoons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6c45563a7a666e39d0f163c7dabdc61c1cac7ebb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7b1a94ab4014035b144ee560e1e334d8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Happy Birthday in jazz, rock, ska, and swing — because one version is never enough — plus bouncy kids' tunes, silly bug adventures, and playful melodies that make everything feel like a party. Perfect for birthdays, animations, and any moment that calls for pure, unfiltered fun.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="solocellomeditations_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="solocellomeditations_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Solo Cello Meditations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/be602b994ff8457402441f9ae28eadde1dcc4c97.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a40d9adb9d4abfc612cbd6d42787b455"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Solo Cello Meditations is a curated collection of 10 classical works performed for solo cello, drawing from the repertoire of Bach, Saint-Saëns, Tchaikovsky, Rossini, Haydn, and Beethoven. From elegant baroque suites and romantic sonatas to deeply expressive laments, this pack offers timeless musical depth for film, documentary, and any production requiring the singular intimacy of the cello.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="soloviolinandviolajourneys_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="soloviolinandviolajourneys_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Solo Violin &amp; Viola Journeys&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/33c71956017d20801c7d770f5982714bafdaee1a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dce20d981b5205081fbf6691d1cd5746"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A refined collection of 10 works drawn from the string repertoire's most expressive voices. From the courtly elegance of Bach's BWV 1042 and the noble lyricism of Mendelssohn's Opus 12 to the ceremonial warmth of Haydn's Opus 76 and the searching intensity of solo cadenzas, this pack captures the full emotional range of the bowed string — intimate, virtuosic, and utterly timeless. Essential for productions that demand the authority of the classical tradition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="retrofutures"&gt;&lt;a id="retrofutures"&gt;Retro Futures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e39bf83626c18e945bf0f20ddc6b1039ca1cc4f4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=402b6634c1de5e175b35a076b8f53066"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;"Retro Futures" is a collection of vintage synth and lo-fi cues for classic, low-budget sci-fi atmosphere. This bundle captures the eerie, analog charm of 70s/80s sci-fi with pulsing electronics, suspenseful drones, and cassette-tape tension—perfect for cosmic mysteries, eerie alien signals, and nostalgic space exploration.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="echoesfromepsilon"&gt;&lt;a id="echoesfromepsilon"&gt;Echoes From Epsilon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e088a338f7fc5acebde3c26e1a33177c8c78b87e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=34edbfa9042b1521edf76aa7c2b37c70"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;"Echoes from Epsilon" is a cinematic sci-fi treasure for psychological tension and cosmic melancholy. It moves from heartbreaking orchestral laments to tracks of creeping, percussive dread—scoring deep-space isolation, derelict ships, and unseen threats. Perfect for stories of loss, regret, and slow-burning paranoia in the void.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="phantomfreight"&gt;&lt;a id="phantomfreight"&gt;Phantom Freight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3253dd5cb067324e0fd0ba7a1367e0b1fdd87d12.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fc05a326007302540e9b993ce17a88a8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;"Phantom Freight" is a dark suspense playlist for sci-fi horror and cosmic dread. This collection of eerie drones, ticking-clock tension, and explosive percussive scares is designed for haunted spacecraft, derelict outposts, and encounters with unknowable, malevolent entities in the void.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="grandfleet"&gt;&lt;a id="grandfleet"&gt;The Grand Fleet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/689801f4c64f82c6f5dd7ae3619cba160fe7cb58.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9997936e19dfb9779ce4c6fb65c29188"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;"The Grand Fleet" is an epic orchestral list for colossal sci-fi warfare and naval might. This collection features majestic brass, thunderous percussion, and heroic marches—perfect for massive fleet deployments, historic space battles, and the awe-inspiring spectacle of an interstellar armada.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="atmosphericburn"&gt;&lt;a id="atmosphericburn"&gt;Atmospheric Burn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4ab0e9add3436fb37fc1880c3b572e62369cc868.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=df63200d44ea8ee481c05dac48295e88"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;"Atmospheric Burn" is high-energy, gritty rock for sci-fi action. It scores rebel uprisings, dystopian chases, and defiant last stands with aggressive guitars and driving rhythms. This is the sound of resistance in a broken world.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="deepspacephenomena"&gt;&lt;a id="deepspacephenomena"&gt;Deep Space Phenomena&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5f057d73c3af77dce2e4ad031266f04587ee56cd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=419ec7de202fd8262946f46b01ae5823"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;"Deep Space Phenomena" is a sound design toolkit for sci-fi isolation and cosmic mystery. This collection features sonar pings, deep drones, garbled transmissions, and metallic echoes to build immersive ambiences of derelict ships, alien signals, and the unnerving silence between stars. Perfect for atmospheric tension and world-building in the void.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="scifilabs"&gt;&lt;a id="scifilabs"&gt;Sci Fi Labs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/eb130cf2bbd105f31d989123189c8cd6061f3101.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=56fbf8e68735b742a50f3a38c8081870"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;"Sci-Fi Labs" is a group of sounds for futuristic labs. It includes bubbling experiments, humming machines, laser zaps, and the noise of lab disasters—perfect for building a science outpost in space.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ventsandresonance"&gt;&lt;a id="ventsandresonance"&gt;Vents &amp; Resonance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f4845fe51f1561b32a5aaa3364653764fe16a638.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=24a1271c968c5b398e3b198b1d4d3862"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Vents &amp;amp; Resonance&amp;nbsp;– the sci-fi collection for gritty atmosphere. Get industrial vent blasts, echoing metal hits, and deep reactor hums. Soundtrack your cyberpunk city, derelict starship, or hidden bunker with raw, textured noise that feels fresh, cool, and immersive.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="miningcoloniesonplanets"&gt;&lt;a id="miningcoloniesonplanets"&gt;Mining Colonies on Planets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2cb5dea003eef84101e1a0da78e94b50025e0310.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e68ccd6261e499dead1af70b6e1d5e0f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Mining Colonies on Planets&amp;nbsp;– a sci-fi playlist of industrial work. Rock drills, tunnel echoes, and clattering machines soundtrack your frontier outpost, asteroid dig, or deep-core drilling site.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="paralleldimensionsanddriftenergy"&gt;&lt;a id="paralleldimensionsanddriftenergy"&gt;Parallel Dimensions &amp; Drift Energy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2bd52ff0d88b4ce3500416c495a707ae803163c1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a30b2c73520093837ae1f43aa79520f2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Parallel Dimensions &amp;amp; Drift Energy&amp;nbsp;– an SFX pack of unstable reality. Get portal whooshes, tonal oscillations, and heavy modulations for alternate timelines, unstable rifts, and sci-fi experiments with time and space.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cosmichorrortech"&gt;&lt;a id="cosmichorrortech"&gt;Cosmic Horror Tech&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/58f510239f490aa7d19ebb18e004dd266083ee7c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9e2a3f4e61459902064a3ceab2ebd226"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Cosmic Horror Tech&amp;nbsp;– a playlist of glitched-out dread. Features cosmic swells, void rumbles, and digital malfunctions. Soundtrack your alien signal from the void, corrupted AI, or tech overwhelmed by something ancient.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="legendarythemes"&gt;&lt;a id="legendarythemes"&gt;Legendary Themes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3dd4fc7668c2d32ecc02f2107831d5c6bdd606c8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1cce764544ed73c7e821a4d47bd1d0d7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The definitive source for heroic storytelling, blending triumphant orchestral fanfares, poignant emotional themes, and determined ceremonial marches to score everything from legendary game trailers and blockbuster film moments to heartfelt documentaries and inspiring brand campaigns. Elevate your narrative. Become legendary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="orchestraldreams"&gt;&lt;a id="orchestraldreams"&gt;Orchestral Dreams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cb308ba47da8830b7eaaa159be76f6cdf62a742b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0f172ffbef2d699a9100e9076f4015c0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This collection embodies the highest standards of musical excellence, featuring elegant minuets, dramatic symphonic movements, and profound operatic interludes. It is the definitive resource for projects requiring an air of cultivated sophistication, profound emotional depth, and unwavering prestige.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="moviemagic"&gt;&lt;a id="moviemagic"&gt;Movie Magic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b026df38374d39011d119e1af94724aab8fc8b8d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1a30dc08efa23c8b5487b95cd2a82beb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Intimate piano, haunting strings, soaring brass, heroic choirs, and pulse-pounding orchestral hits set the tone for every emotional turn. Move through heartbreak and suspense to hope, triumph, and epic trailer energy—built for adventure, fantasy, drama, documentaries, and powerful storytelling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="adrenalinerush"&gt;&lt;a id="adrenalinerush"&gt;Adrenaline Rush&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1dc81bed935053474fd0bc360d241cd8d6624e98.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f27de5ec6481fb4eddf24869245b3734"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Adrenaline Rush delivers tracks of raw, unfiltered sonic aggression, blending pummeling rock, savage electronic pulses, and brutal sports anthems engineered for maximum impact. Soundtrack the final push, the game-winning play, and the high-octane chase. Drop the beat. Start the riot.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="blockbusterbeasts"&gt;&lt;a id="blockbusterbeasts"&gt;Blockbuster Beasts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/36a5e83165fec18040acd713ea2f517d583c5810.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e554baae894c7fa799580b18eb6546b9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Unleash raw, cinematic power. This pack of explosive tracks is your ultimate weapon for high-octane storytelling, blending skull-crushing metal, driving orchestral action, and gritty rock anthems to fuel everything from epic sports highlights and brutal trailers to intense gameplay and investigative thrillers. Command the energy. Dominate the scene.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="spacehord"&gt;&lt;a id="spacehord"&gt;Space Horde&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f065638bdaf9eda413cae44b5829c8d95b9d17e3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6d0638f314b9576db8d7144b691501a2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Fuel your sci-fi epics and ambient journeys. This collection of 12 atmospheric tracks is your command center for the cosmos, blending deep-space tension, eerie ambience, and driving electronic pulses to score everything from interstellar horror and cyberpunk tension to serene orbital vistas and introspective dreams. Launch your next visionary project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="shadowsfall"&gt;&lt;a id="shadowsfall"&gt;Shadows Fall&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8e51dc2f3014de99cb3270e65fb97e6bb4825eed.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e889593b1c41aff34a2e69ec954d6f1e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Dark atmospheres, uneasy rhythms, twisted textures, and sinister urban pulses set the stage for what’s coming next. Built for horror, true crime, thrillers, and suspense-driven scenes where every sound adds another layer of tension. Let it build. Let the fear take over.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rockrage"&gt;&lt;a id="rockrage"&gt;Rock Rage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bd13bcb3e332fbe1b04d1a4c8df0bd6b86d73a79.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fd7314e68bac3c827ec88e24ef358d5f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Built for high-octane sports highlights, intense gameplay montages, and any scene that demands raw, unfiltered power. This is the sound of rebellion, competition, and pure adrenaline. Smash the ceiling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="acousticrock_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="acousticrock_audiohero"&gt;Acoustic Rock&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/602c77519fd5319aac7731fa00f23c3934a768ad.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f76236e7b4adcc34cf428f8f1fc1ef7f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Forty professionally crafted acoustic rock tracks designed for broadcast, corporate, and commercial applications. Featuring warm, well-mixed guitars, solid rhythmic foundations, and tasteful arrangements that avoid overproduction. The collection spans upbeat, driving anthems suitable for promotional content and lifestyle branding, as well as more restrained, introspective ballads for narrative-driven projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="retrorevival"&gt;&lt;a id="retrorevival"&gt;Retro Revival&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1bcc324730bcc72765df494ab7eb1d11f089a14c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fc476ab48cfbe0128c7642545c149ccc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A time capsule of classic cool, blending swaggering '80s rock, pulsing synthwave, and iconic TV themes. From confident intros and tense detective cues to smooth tropical escapes, this collection is your secret weapon for throwback commercials, retro gaming, and content that demands authentic vintage flair. Rewind the clock. Make it classic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="edm"&gt;&lt;a id="edm"&gt;EDM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/388698aa45334bea01cb03e38982c14c9e8b4d45.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=adf8e376d7bd1f2eeb8ca2d732d4371e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Lose yourself in the pulsating rhythms of this expertly curated EDM playlist. It spams genres like electro house, dubstep, trance and more. Get ready to turn up the energy and experience an electrifying EDM adventure with this 50 tracks of hard hitting beats and motivational moods. From uplifting vibes to aggressive pulsating melodies this playlist will put you in the perfect mindset to power through any workout, commercial or advertising task, or night out. Turn up the volume and feel the beat!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pop"&gt;&lt;a id="pop"&gt;Pop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6d50cebaa94402c54ba8047dcb3117043a523057.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2bfcf95028db5139cb1bfea7ad86a9c3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This 30-track pop collection delivers feel-good energy from start to finish. Expect crisp acoustic guitars, infectious synth hooks, future bass drops, handclaps, vocal chops, and driving beats built for summer vibes, lifestyle content, and commercial appeal. From breezy indie-pop and cheerful acoustic grooves to high-energy electronic anthems, these tracks are polished, upbeat, and engineered to make any project shine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="urbanbeats_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="urbanbeats_audiohero"&gt;Urban Beats&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/16ba73e5815c84e05759c694eea9f8f36d9282ef.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=00d29a9df523f9f487341fa93d0861bc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Turn up the volume with Urban Beats - the hottest new music playlist bursting with the freshest urban tunes. This pulse-pounding collection features the illest beats and most fire flows from today's top rappers and producers. The driving basslines and hypnotic rhythms will get your energy pumping. With a mix of club bangers, chill trap and old school classics, these fresh urban flavors have something for all fans of modern hip hop. Urban Beats is created for music lovers craving the newest and best rhythms. Bring on the urban fire!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dramascenes"&gt;&lt;a id="dramascenes"&gt;Drama Scenes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/382e060423cd4b5e8b60e761c5775b444c515178.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=be6d87f90338ffa23420c5c2bf273898"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Profound intimacy and minimalist tension, designed for the heart of the story. From haunting, suspended atmospheres and melancholic indie strolls to tender, tear-jerking piano motifs, this collection scores the unspoken—the quiet confessions, the lonely struggles, and the raw, human reveals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="happyfeelgood_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="happyfeelgood_audiohero"&gt;Happy Feel Good&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/734057c4d23c7aef9507e7fcfdd1d1ccddc3b81d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9234564dab381570c528aa095a3d559a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Toe-tapping acoustic pop, bouncy indie folk, and tropical house that makes you want to dance around the kitchen. Handclaps, whistling, ukulele, and glockenspiel. Skipping through the park. Rolling down the highway with the windows open. Good friends, lazy afternoons, and that burst of joy when everything just clicks. Weekend content, summer reels, feel-good commercials, and creators spreading smiles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="lifestyle_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="lifestyle_audiohero"&gt;Lifestyle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b311f727b5160723854ee13381a04ee50da5f00f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b523b79e0633417837cf288f29a54242"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Good vibes only. Toe-tapping acoustic pop, laid-back indie folk, and tropical house that feels like a permanent vacation. Handclaps and finger snaps. Whistling choruses and warm, soulful guitars. This collection is the soundtrack to golden hours, road trips, coffee dates, and everything that feels like a deep breath.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="children"&gt;&lt;a id="children"&gt;Children&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4690a4a1cbebf38511a150079ed6fa4a8519b2e4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=02e1f17b8ca2d95686214a5d0bc042de"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Bouncy. Bright. Pure, unfiltered happiness. Ukuleles and handclaps. Pizzicato strings and jingle bells. Wobbly trombones and sparkly music boxes. Toe-tapping indie folk, silly reggae pop, and lullabies that whisper "sleep tight." This collection is a playground of sound—carefree, whimsical, and bursting with giggles. Nap time. Playtime. Anytime little ones need a smile. No grown-up stuffiness. Just joy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="christmasandholiday_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="christmasandholiday_audiohero"&gt;Christmas / Holidays&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3ac9fb0b6b4d81852d22ee4313e61bd204844cc1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=180aed32527b19866ee8cccbcf493de8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Warm. Nostalgic. Joyfully familiar. Jingle bells, silent nights, and sugar plum fairies. Triumphant choruses, gentle lullabies, and playful elf antics. Crackling fireplaces, sparkling music boxes, and the quiet magic of snowfall. This collection captures every shade of the season—from solemn reverence to exuberant celebration. Holiday content, family videos, retail playlists, and creators spreading cheer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="adventureawaits_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="adventureawaits_audiohero"&gt;Adventure Awaits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/94e3c8493d17960229b591964161cf96053bba04.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dbccbeece58e3642dfc94fc2f6ec1b8d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;African lakeshores, Amazon jungles, desert nights, medieval caves, and open skies. Lions, horses, vintage aircraft, jungle wildlife, and thunderstorms sit alongside foley footsteps, boat engines, and cinematic stingers. Everything you need to make a world feel real and alive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="explosionzone"&gt;&lt;a id="explosionzone"&gt;Explosions Zone&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3c18898899aafbcc4a4b74a9819cf81bd705688f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3176aee5af4d389adefc76a21ff2f456"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;From precision pipe bomb blasts and black powder charges to battlefield artillery, car explosions, meteor impacts, and sci-fi detonations — every layer, every rumble, and every shockwave is here. When your scene calls for the moment everything changes, this pack delivers the sound that makes audiences feel it in their chest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="classicconsole"&gt;&lt;a id="classicconsole"&gt;Classic Console&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/59ecfc19186f6fee5ae145c8713407515f6c1242.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e9cfe715c636196b125931a8e4ef5d5c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Classic Console is a pack of 25 retro game sound effects straight from the arcade era — laser blasts, level-up chimes, futuristic console beeps, hyper drive whooshes, and everything in between. From 8-bit alerts to sci-fi interface tones, this pack covers every interaction, notification, and power-up moment your game or video needs. Pure nostalgia, pixel-perfect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="spaceodyssey"&gt;&lt;a id="spaceodyssey"&gt;Space Oddyssey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/74d6c7a5e5225dffbc33bf86d046851b3792e516.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4f7a57760791d2e12a12f50d044340d6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Space Odyssey is a pack of 25 sound effects recorded from beyond the edge of the known universe. Gravity flux pulses, ice planet crackles, meteor showers, alien atmospheres, and moon surface drones — plus warp drives, pod ejections, satellite signals, and the terrifying silence just before a black hole swallows everything whole. For worlds that don't exist yet, this is their sound.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="glitchdominion_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="glitchdominion_audiohero"&gt;Glitch Dominion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1dae994ed6edf48201bd5e621801271bbb6649b3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=26325c37eae5b5b1cfd8904db70d7047"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Error tones, digital distortions, 8-bit malfunctions, sensor static, power hum failures, and processing glitches — every frequency here signals something going wrong in exactly the right way. Whether you're building a corrupted UI, a hacked interface, or a world where the code is falling apart, this pack has the sonic fingerprint of a system in collapse.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dynamicswishes"&gt;&lt;a id="dynamicswishes"&gt;Dynamic Swishes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf78a508cb318c88e6fcfb1dab0ed4e50508e293.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9b64f761eef0b594bf21f167f3fe2ea5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Fast whistling whooshes, dark malevolent sweeps, alien photon bursts, laser zaps, sci-fi vortexes, missile fly-bys, and portal passes — every variation of motion and impact is covered. The invisible glue that makes every cut, reveal, and action sequence hit exactly right.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="slowmotion_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="slowmotion_audiohero"&gt;Slow Motion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dc7d7af92a9a5e429209e4c8be9b56b6f993c906.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=acee18cab79a5ea61e73da6cd9cc978b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Reverberant impacts, tension drones, alien heartbeats, transporter beams, sonar pings, and celestial space voices — every sound here is built to make a fraction of a second feel cinematic and inevitable. For the hits, reveals, and turning points that deserve to last longer than they should.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fightclub"&gt;&lt;a id="fightclub"&gt;Fight Club&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/310b9f9ff5fdf063dbaed59ddab7dc4d165a30f5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=877736037c3f997da97bc6ad30b1b32d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Bone-crunching face punches, heavy kicks, low thud impacts, grunts of pain, and the raw chaos of bodies in conflict — every sound here is built to make your fight sequences feel real, brutal, and uncomfortably close. No music. No glamour. Just the sound of someone losing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crashsmashbreak_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="crashsmashbreak_audiohero"&gt;Crash, Smash, Break!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c1cf56ff7a2cbc4e023748ac91a2414891668480.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=146a6dbc448a47e6915c6b88fd5f2706"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Shattering glass, splintering wood doors, bending metal, ice breaking, ceiling collapses, and debris cascading across concrete — every impact here is physical, immediate, and satisfying. Whether something is being destroyed on purpose or by accident, this pack makes it sound exactly as catastrophic as it should.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mechanical_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="mechanical_audiohero"&gt;Mechanical&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8c194c36c3d3335477d81c91b5d55a5fed125734.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a8b0eca0261bcceda153f56a18d9525a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Robot morphs, ratcheting mechanisms, diesel engines, band saws, hammers on metal, cranking levers, and servo chirps — every sound here has weight, function, and texture. Perfect for industrial sequences, robotics, workshop scenes, or any production that needs the satisfying reality of machinery at work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="magic_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="magic_audiohero"&gt;Magic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2737e41508e66f3d261986a5de9c9e9b04857599.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fc7e710ce0df55a3afc25f032fcdbabf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Sparkling spells, fairy wings, magical zaps, wand strikes, choral drones, eerie accents, black magic ambiences, and fantasy atmospheres — from playful cartoon enchantment to dark supernatural menace. Everything your wizards, witches, and otherworldly creatures need to sound like they mean it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="musicalelements_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="musicalelements_audiohero"&gt;Musical Elements&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/421e0f4b11a493078ad5ae735131232d72c23f9e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4da059142fbf8b1b954dd376912bf01e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Musical Elements is a pack of 50 individual musical cues, stingers, and accents drawn from across the orchestral and acoustic spectrum. Symphonic hits, timpani rolls, cymbal crashes, harp glissandos, brass stabs, gong crescendos, electric guitar sustains, and comedy accents — each element is a precision tool for punctuating edits, underscoring transitions, and shaping emotional beats at the compositional level. Essential for editors and sound designers who need expressive musical building blocks on demand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="water_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="water_audiohero"&gt;Water&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4c291609f8ca33163da8a279c425cc38b2c983fd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2271faf2f4732eb34d706fdbebc3f861"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Water SFX is 50 recordings that capture every form water takes — from single drips echoing in a cave and babbling brooks to raging river rapids, crashing ocean surf, and massive waterfalls roaring up close. Underwater ambiences, Mediterranean waves, splashes, streams, and stormy seas round out a pack built for any scene where nature needs to be heard. Pure, versatile, and endlessly atmospheric.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voicepacks_adultfemale_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="voicepacks_adultfemale_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Voice Packs: Adult Female&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/74691ab4bff9f96c5c3b12b12abc777ffef527be.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b95b898ba6a7467edffd1cd0e905743f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Authentic female vocal recordings covering the full range of human expression — laughter, distress, effort, reaction, and everything in between. From a witch's cackle and a hailing whistle to crying, struggling, and genuine human moments, this pack gives your characters a real voice. Essential for games, animations, and any production that needs women to sound human.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voicepacks_adultmale_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="voicepacks_adultmale_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Voice Packs: Adult Male&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ee2edaac3c8bafba9a33db282eda23b60ec735fe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2f405fd7ede5a600e72b81eef17a2dfd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;10 male vocal recordings capturing the raw, unscripted side of human expression — hard laughter, panicked screams, exertion grunts, crying, throat clears, and everything that happens when someone forgets they're being recorded. Grounded, versatile, and instantly recognizable, this pack brings authentic male presence to games, animations, and any scene that needs a real human reaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voicepacks_children_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="voicepacks_children_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Voice Packs: Children&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/00911af7f00dca88039f45fd5b45ab2dc30a21cd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2bfbd9f5ba0308c3295bfeff0f82ec24"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Voice Packs: Children is 10 recordings of real kids — laughing, crying, playing, whispering, and just being kids. From toddler babble to playground tears and 12-year-old goofing around, this pack covers the authentic sounds of childhood. Simple, genuine, and immediately recognizable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voicepacks_teenagers_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="voicepacks_teenagers_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Voice Packs: Teenagers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e434ae6aac9a20a435c7d5ef89d97ba9bc99b6ba.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ca00f5740f76c4b9af73cadd6acc3558"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Sighs, scoffs, gasps, groans, short laughs, and the kind of scream that happens before anyone can think. Real reactions, zero filter. Perfect for games, animations, and any project that needs young characters to actually sound their age.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animals_flockofbirds_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="animals_flockofbirds_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Animals: Flock of Birds&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cb59d44d43a2ae0f9d714975df08075dd28add36.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=221d073b279ac52c540064d2e101e099"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Animals: Flock of Birds is 20 recordings capturing birds in motion and in chorus — pigeons taking flight, Canada geese honking, starling chatter, gannets squawking, mallards, greylag geese, and even penguins calling in a crowd. From a single flock lifting off to a full ambience of wings and calls, this pack brings the natural world to life wherever your scene needs it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animals_reptiles_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="animals_reptiles_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Animals: Reptiles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3e5c87e80c4a5f227782efbbeef62143b9ad5ff1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bc79a26bcc0839ae9a5040df1e825e3c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Animals: Reptiles is 20 recordings from the cold-blooded side of the animal kingdom — rattlesnake rattles, alligator growls and hisses, crocodile grunts, snake slithers, gecko calls, frog ambiences, and even a giant reptile low growl. From swamp nights to jungle floors and prehistoric menace, this pack covers every scale and slither your production needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animals_hugemammals_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="animals_hugemammals_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Animals: Huge Mammals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/70db7b808347d3cc12099728f8e07b0bfc2545c5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ff54699bbd94488c9c85780b65dc059d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Animals: Huge Mammals is 10 recordings from the largest and loudest creatures on earth — lion growls, tiger roars, elephant trumpets, bear growls, humpback whale calls, buffalo grunts, and wild boar in a forest. Raw, powerful, and unmistakably alive. For any scene that needs the presence of something much bigger than you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animals_smallmammals_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="animals_smallmammals_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Animals: Small Mammals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1842998af5ea3b5b47b3c931b504030eb269b3dd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9899c623d5fd4348ae4809442a814438"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Animals: Small Mammals is 20 recordings from the smaller, scrappier side of the animal kingdom — chihuahua growls, monkey screeches, rat packs, mouse squeaks, squirrel chirps, bats screeching, a rabbit in distress, otters, guinea pigs, and even a giant rat growl. Small in size, big in character. Perfect for nature scenes, horror, comedy, and everything in between.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dolbyatmosvol1_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="dolbyatmosvol1_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Dolby Atmos Vol 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8509b370175c13533e977bc5a72ba98fcc620274.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7d956ce71640501dfd98e7fe81f2680d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Dolby Atmos Vol. 1 is 20 immersive spatial audio recordings designed to wrap your audience in a complete sonic environment. From countryside winds and forest rain to suburban evenings, underground car parks, thunderstorms, and a thousand crows circling a city — every track is captured and mixed for full three-dimensional playback. For productions where sound doesn't just accompany the picture, it becomes the space itself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dolbyatmosvol2_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="dolbyatmosvol2_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Dolby Atmos Vol 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b269a9d4949c45fb26b272d340ca705fdb1a91e9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=287b0ec6c9d4e212c72e26ffa8c3188d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Dolby Atmos Vol. 2 is 20 more immersive spatial recordings expanding the sonic world in every direction — morning birdsong over a forest lake, Central Park at dawn, river rapids, hurricane winds snapping tree branches, distant automatic weapons fire, an underwater abyss, and the roar of a dune buggy race. Each track is engineered for three-dimensional playback, placing your audience inside the environment rather than in front of it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="undergroundandcaves_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="undergroundandcaves_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Underground &amp; Caves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a14afa6bf67c3fa1a2051a2d02f642ccabf35611.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=99ccb2d805014af2d47f43a274811abe"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Underground &amp;amp; Caves is 20 recordings from the deepest, darkest places beneath the surface — dripping cave water, ghostly wind tunnels, hollow earth rumbles, bat caves, medieval caverns, sci-fi planet caves, and eerie underground streams. From ancient stone chambers to horror tunnels and distant underground explosions, this pack puts your audience somewhere they can't easily get back from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cyberwarfare_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="cyberwarfare_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Cyber Warfare&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4ad149743c14912348715c6499d1cbe371b60638.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=298b7f05ef52c4be6788deb616baf889"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Rapid-fire laser weapons, stun guns, and sci-fi blaster shots. Massive space battle ambiences filled with fighters, explosions, and constant laser fire. Spaceship fly-bys, hyperspace exits, and heavy cruiser movement. Cyber impacts, digital crashes, jumps, and futuristic interface hits. Ready to unleash full-scale sci-fi combat in your next project?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="questsandopenworlds_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="questsandopenworlds_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Quests &amp; Open Worlds&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4e102228f1cb013ac77281b974b20b32be51f925.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=200d8d51ea2a33ee0d18f6c007d3bb9d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Step through the portal. Somewhere, a temple bell rings — once, then silence. The forest breathes. Magic stirs in the spaces between sounds: a distant coyote's call, wind threading through desert stone, the thunder of hooves across open ground, a shooting star dissolving into the dark. This is the sound of worlds waiting to be walked.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3 id="naturaldisasters_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="naturaldisasters_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Natural Disasters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/74082c2d49cd2e009df685dd7eb707978c3c47d3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f5faad766d7c5ea5cda153d75c1e484b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Natural Disasters Vol. 1 is 20 recordings of the earth at its most destructive — storm waves, hurricane winds, earthquakes rattling houses from the inside, avalanches of rock and debris, underwater rumbles, and tornadoes tearing through everything in their path. Raw, low-frequency, and deeply unsettling, this pack puts the full force of nature directly into your production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vulcanoes_gameaudiocollection"&gt;&lt;a id="vulcanoes_gameaudiocollection"&gt;Vulcanoes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a140533fd79f29f63c6b8aad355581ed246c38fc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=567dfb147d5fad45291ad124357c8db4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Volcanoes SFX is 20 recordings from inside and around active volcanoes — bubbling lava wells, deep eruption rumbles, steam hisses, lava flows, underwater volcanic stress, and long slow builds to full explosive eruption. Captured from real locations including the Azores and Yellowstone, this pack delivers the raw geological power that no synthesizer can replicate. For disaster sequences, sci-fi worlds, and anything that needs the earth itself to sound angry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="activeaura"&gt;&lt;a id="activeaura"&gt;Active Aura&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e8369a5166bf3ddc664e677ec8ca0f2ac9c8fe2c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7feb56b480631d4d8bb52c4a7a7b2776"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Active Aura is 20 sound effects built for creators who make content that moves — gym ambiences, boxing training, jump rope, karate workouts, running footsteps, weight room clangs, stair climbers, and the satisfying exhale after a hard set. Whether you're producing fitness videos, sports content, or workout reels, this pack gives your edits the energy and authenticity your audience can feel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3 id="retrotransmission"&gt;&lt;a id="retrotransmission"&gt;Retro Transmission&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/78e2030713a3f70e9c6571764bb8d7bf3b06f1fe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f02746bb301983482b01960c2b2d7e12"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Retro Transmission is 20 sounds from the golden age of broadcasting — vintage radios switching on, analog dials tuning across bands, ham radio operators, TV static, dead channels, channel surfing, and rotary dial clicks. From a 1938 Stromberg console to a flickering CRT screen, this pack captures the warm, crackling imperfection of an era when signals had to be found&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3 id="omniverse"&gt;&lt;a id="omniverse"&gt;Omniverse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6faca627b262ae333081e7d994a4d05695bdbef4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=20720f9f8af99c6e86bf16d3069e5f54"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A diverse collection of cosmic drones, futuristic technology, space effects, atmospheric textures, and otherworldly ambiences for sci-fi, fantasy, games, and cinematic productions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="transportationandmotion"&gt;&lt;a id="transportationandmotion"&gt;Transportation &amp; Motion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c3eb5ab494fe54f929845dbc1c9f9a2dac99ac64.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=24c1a535a48b4f037dc76d838040862a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;From rumbling subway tunnels and bustling train stations to the hum of city buses and Venice’s water taxis — this playlist captures the heartbeat of global transit.&lt;br&gt;Each track drops you into real motion: airport crowds, street traffic with police horses, windy terminals, and even a Buenos Aires bus ride.&lt;br&gt;Perfect for filmmakers, game designers, or anyone needing authentic, immersive transportation ambience with character and depth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="industrialandmechanical"&gt;&lt;a id="industrialandmechanical"&gt;Industrial &amp; Mechanical&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/97fd37d415581744145f0fe6142557a9de8583d9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e1e8d86aaaebfeaf3b7ad330561cc67c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Raw factory energy. Heavy machinery roar, stamping presses, clanking pipes, and hissing gas lines. From massive production halls to empty, dripping warehouses—this is the sound of steel, steam, and sweat. Perfect for dystopian worlds, cyberpunk scenes, tech breakdowns, and any creator who wants their content to hit with industrial weight. No polish. Just power.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="household"&gt;&lt;a id="household"&gt;Household&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4a6ce6588b4b5c46a14e44de16eb398811dbc294.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6b418d46b12fdc04a06d5cef9875472e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The sound of living. Raw, real, and uncomfortably close. Toaster pops, scissors snip, keys drop, and the refrigerator breathes in the dark. From buzzing doorbells and ringing flip phones to hissing gas stoves and grinding coffee machines—this isn't a home makeover. It's the messy, mechanical, sometimes annoying pulse of everyday life. Perfect for ASMR, relatable creator skits, horror hidden in plain sight, or anyone who wants to make the ordinary feel loud. Welcome home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3 id="africaandjungles"&gt;&lt;a id="africaandjungles"&gt;Africa &amp; Jungles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dfcf561921b1016c3ce562d45ce04224a2debef8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=abd4e78623f15784aece22550fbb98d2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Untamed. Alive. Unforgiving. Insects sizzle, parrots scream, and drums pulse through dense, breathing green. Heavy with birds and hidden movement—this isn't a safari postcard. It's the raw throat of the wild. Nature docs, survival games, world-building content, creators who want their audience to feel the heat, the humidity, and the eyes watching from the dark. No trails. No guides. Just jungle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="weatherwounds"&gt;&lt;a id="weatherwounds"&gt;Weather Wounds&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fa3a5d764a7ce6c16918023ec27d34940e5f39f9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f7506bf8f501f33d7939d9e3c01d8ac3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Want to capture the harsh, lonely beauty of wounded weather? This moves from the quiet ache of falling snow and a light, splattery drizzle to the fierce howl of arctic winds and a heavy blizzard's whip. It builds with deep, moaning gusts through a wooden barn, the sharp crack of lightning, and the distant rumble of desert thunder.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cozyandsafe"&gt;&lt;a id="cozyandsafe"&gt;Cozy &amp; Safe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c31db2e03dbe72cf6f80a2b6f4cbb640ec806212.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d26cdcc0f8f92934167431610c77a330"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Settle into the sound of pure comfort. A crackling fireplace, rain tapping softly against the window, flowing streams, distant highway hums, and rustling autumn leaves come together to create warm, peaceful atmospheres made for cozy moments, quiet escapes, and relaxing scenes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="calmandhealing"&gt;&lt;a id="calmandhealing"&gt;Calm &amp; Healing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/139bd18800fc9e55249140907232471dffcc7bd8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=39f85115db1fced14b732caa7aad8d90"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Create a peaceful, restorative atmosphere with ethereal choirs, soft ambient drones, resonant Tibetan chimes, and delicate vintage wind chimes. Gentle sonar tones and soothing spa bubbles add depth and texture, making this collection ideal for meditation, relaxation, wellness, and serene scenes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="isolatedandlonely"&gt;&lt;a id="isolatedandlonely"&gt;Isolated &amp; Lonely&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d59d0b6c38ac50728e0302c5da909ec5809d1b00.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=51a39a5bd99ee8ba18bd246c34c8e833"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This collection crafts a profound sense of isolation and haunting atmosphere. It moves from the lonely, fluorescent hum of a late-night gas station to the eerie, empty drones of alien hives and cavernous industrial spaces. Layer in the dissonant ambience of rainy city alleys, the distant echo of an empty hallway, and the isolated rumble of a dormant volcano for deeply atmospheric, melancholic scenes.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="celebrationandfestivity"&gt;&lt;a id="celebrationandfestivity"&gt;Celebration &amp; Festivity&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0ab3f88f719eb93259ee8ed8b6f7346f479903e4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2065c55fb40ba04d75782bf0c129bf25"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;From explosive New Year’s celebrations and honking street festivals to bustling Christmas malls and lively packed pubs, capture the energy of the season. Add popping champagne and roaring stadium crowds to create vibrant, festive scenes filled with excitement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="childrenandplay"&gt;&lt;a id="childrenandplay"&gt;Children &amp; Play&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/58a19dbdc527c70205ae46bda84eb823e3f897b0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e23065d37e05cadb794461366197e980"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Capture the lively, unpredictable energy of childhood with playful playground screams, bustling school cafeterias, and splash-filled indoor pools. From laughter and chatter to full-on kid chaos, this collection brings authentic movement, excitement, and youthful energy to any scene.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="conflictandbattle"&gt;&lt;a id="conflictandbattle"&gt;Conflict &amp; Battle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f67af7b01f718d5e5e6f3b8eb01a83f3becb3e51.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9b5761b82f87a854a9fe2962b4efbdfb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Experience an intense range of battle and combat sounds, from historic muskets and medieval clashes to machine-gun fire, artillery blasts, bullet impacts, naval cannons, and flamethrowers. Chaotic battlefield ambiences and powerful crowd reactions add depth and realism to warfare scenes across different eras and settings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="directorsaudiences"&gt;&lt;a id="directorsaudiences"&gt;The Director's Audiences&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c1f2b54796d1e06fbede471f30258528549de779.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d6fb0757022c379bb27dc7b056d44daa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;spanquattrocento sans="" arial="" font-weight:normal="" font-style:normal="" color:="" 0f1115="" data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This set delivers the authentic, nuanced sounds of a live audience. It captures the anticipatory murmur of a crowd settling in, the rustle of movement in wooden seats, and the scattered coughs of a quiet theater. The emotional range extends from polite, pre-concert clapping to enthusiastic ovations and the collective, sympathetic "aww" of a vintage recording. It's the complete sonic backdrop of a captivated audience, from arrival to exit.&lt;/spanquattrocento&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vloglifeessentials_audiohero"&gt;&lt;a id="vloglifeessentials_audiohero"&gt;Vlog Life Essentials&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6aebf87d5246d332dbf355405189470dc27e6f05.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9f36fe78d1ebc2b902400b509678afe0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Give your content the sound it deserves. Snap the shutter, fire up the coffee machine, hit the gym, pop the champagne—everyday moments with instant energy and personality. Perfect for vlogs, reels, lifestyle edits, and social content that needs to feel real, fresh, and alive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="podcastcreatorsfx"&gt;&lt;a id="podcastcreatorsfx"&gt;Podcast Creator SFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e2c0faa7ccfd66291552ff28aa3571d92d5b93a6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fec13d4515df4e713312dcf29c9171d5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;From city streets, forest birds, desert winds, and busy airports to keyboard clicks, footsteps, doorbells, and camera shutters, these 50 sounds cover the moments that bring stories to life. Add dramatic hits, suspense accents, magic sparkles, applause, thunder, breaking glass, explosions, and more to give true crime, fiction, comedy, and commentary extra impact, atmosphere, and immersion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="essentialcreatortoolkit"&gt;&lt;a id="essentialcreatortoolkit"&gt;Essential Creator Toolkit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d054cc8adf0876a01aadc4348d6df5da577b3c0f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=afba1487e8d3482c6a6afdca8eff4925"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Build believable everyday scenes with the sounds that make a place feel real. From buzzing cafés, busy offices, city streets, and distant traffic to rain-soaked windows, quiet libraries, study rooms, and subtle indoor crowds, these essential ambiences give creators an instant sense of place. Perfect for vlogs, podcasts, films, social content, and storytelling that needs a natural, lived-in feel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buttonmasters"&gt;&lt;a id="buttonmasters"&gt;Button Masters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9e3226942f57f7c2fd765a1c4fb43d562ec7e3d6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fe4e0b4bf57abc247cfa4414b10219a0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Small clicks, serious impact. From crisp button presses and springy beeps to futuristic console blips, scanner buzzes, telemetry switches, laser clicks, and game-ready surges, these sounds bring instant feedback, energy, and a satisfying tech edge to every interaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="uishaping"&gt;&lt;a id="uishaping"&gt;UI Shaping&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1471d37f8c4ed44bc11d8bd71b6e832b920736f8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b9da486b98d4461bfe7602e5a5502f95"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Click. Confirm. Game on. Power every interaction with punchy UI beeps, satisfying button clicks, arcade energy, and slick screen transitions. Built for menus, HUDs, notifications, upgrades, and in-game actions that need to hit just right.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
