 and AI Tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt12"&gt;Pay $12 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completescrummastercertificationandagilescrumcourse"&gt;The Complete Scrum Master Certification and Agile Scrum Course: Master Scrum and Agile Practices for Effective Project Management&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#masteragileestimation_toptechniquesforscrumandkanban"&gt;Master Agile Estimation - Top Techniques for Scrum and Kanban: Master estimation techniques to enhance planning and accuracy in Scrum and Kanban methodologies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#projectmanagementbestpracticesusingagileandscrum"&gt;Project Management Best Practices using Agile and Scrum: Master Project Success with Agile and Scrum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completescrummastercertificationguide_masterscrumandachieveyouragi"&gt;The Complete Scrum Master Certification Guide: Master Scrum and Achieve Your Agile Certification - From Novice to Expert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#agilereleasemanagementforscrumandkanbanteams"&gt;Agile Release Management for Scrum and Kanban Teams: Mastering Agile Release Strategies with Scrum &amp; Kanban&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#scrummastercertificationtraining_beamasterofscrum_becomeanexpertsc"&gt;Scrum Master Certification Training: Be a Master of Scrum: Become an Expert Scrum Master and Lead Agile Teams to Success&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#scrumadvanced_softwaredevelopmentandprogrammanagement"&gt;Scrum Advanced - Software Development and Program Management: Take Your Scrum Skills to the Next Level with Advanced Techniques and Mastery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pmiagilecertifiedpractitionerpmi-acp_exploringagileprojectmanageme"&gt;PMI Agile Certified Practitioner (PMI-ACP): Exploring Agile Project Management Essentials with PMI-ACP and Beyond&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#expertleadershipandmanagementinagileprojectmanagement_buildingcore"&gt;Expert Leadership and Management in Agile Project Management: Building Core Competencies: Master Agile: From Historical Foundations to Core Principles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#agileproductownerlevel2_comprehensivecertificationguideandmockexam"&gt;Agile Product Owner Level 2 - Comprehensive Certification Guide and Mock Exams: Master Agile Product Ownership and Ace the PSPO II(r) Certification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#agilescrummasterlevelii_certificationprepwithmockexams"&gt;Agile Scrum Master Level II - Certification Prep with Mock Exams: Master Agile Leadership with Advanced Scrum Practices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#scrumrepairguide_getagileteamsbackontrack"&gt;The Scrum Repair Guide - Get Agile Teams Back on Track: Restore Agile Team Performance with Practical Scrum Repair Techniques&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#masteringagilescrum_frombasicstoadvancedwithjiraprojects"&gt;Mastering Agile Scrum - From Basics to Advanced with Jira Projects: Master Agile, Scrum, and Jira for Modern Project Management Success&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ai-enhancedscrummaster_automateanalyseandaccelerateagileworkflow"&gt;The AI-Enhanced Scrum Master - Automate, Analyse, and Accelerate Agile Workflow: Unlock Agile Excellence with Generative AI: Streamline, Automate, and Scale Scrum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#scrummastercrashcourse_advancedpreparationforthepsmiicertification"&gt;Scrum Master Crash Course - Advanced Preparation for the PSM II Certification: Advance Your Scrum Mastery, Leadership Skills, and Agile Thinking for PSM-A Certification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aiprojectmanagementskills_scrummasterplusaipluschatgptplusjira_enh"&gt;AI Project Management skills - Scrum Master+AI+ChatGPT+Jira: Enhance Scr